(899043, 102606, 93, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the harsh coloring of the sky in this shot.  It takes your eye from the subject (which is a little dark), and gives the shot a really poor feel.<br/>The change of shading is very harsh and noticeable as well, although I''m not sure if this was intentional.</td>', 'I really don''t like the harsh coloring of the sky in this shot.  It takes your eye from the subject (which is a little dark), and gives the shot a really poor feel.The change of shading is very harsh and noticeable as well, although I''m not sure if this was intentional.', '2004-09-08 03:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
