(899052, 102537, 93, '<td valign="top">The composition of this photo is absolutely wonder.  I love how you''ve decided to put the center of the "star" to the side of the photograph, gives it a very "landscape" feel.  It''s also very interesting how it both looks backlit.. yet also looks like it''s being lit from the center of the "star" itself.   Great work.. my favorite "leaf" of the challenge :)</td>', 'The composition of this photo is absolutely wonder.  I love how you''ve decided to put the center of the "star" to the side of the photograph, gives it a very "landscape" feel.  It''s also very interesting how it both looks backlit.. yet also looks like it''s being lit from the center of the "star" itself.   Great work.. my favorite "leaf" of the challenge :)', '2004-09-08 03:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(899055, 103434, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, but I would have liked to have seen a slight larger image, and maybe a crop that didn''t cut off the second slat in the upper left.  The colors seem a little desaturated as well and flat. I think if you added a little more contrast, it would help sell the lighting.</td>', 'This is a great idea, but I would have liked to have seen a slight larger image, and maybe a crop that didn''t cut off the second slat in the upper left.  The colors seem a little desaturated as well and flat. I think if you added a little more contrast, it would help sell the lighting.', '2004-09-08 03:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(899056, 102357, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty image, but does not really portray back lit to me. It seems lit from the side, and there could be more light on the back itself. I really like this picture, but it just doesn''t say backlit to me. Maybe I''m being too literal.</td>', 'This is a very pretty image, but does not really portray back lit to me. It seems lit from the side, and there could be more light on the back itself. I really like this picture, but it just doesn''t say backlit to me. Maybe I''m being too literal.', '2004-09-08 03:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(899057, 103964, 93, '<td valign="top">I feel the light is just a little *too* bright. The idea is wonderful, but the wash-out just distracts me too much, and there''s just not enough contrast in the model.</td>', 'I feel the light is just a little *too* bright. The idea is wonderful, but the wash-out just distracts me too much, and there''s just not enough contrast in the model.', '2004-09-08 03:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
