(899060, 103759, 93, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot.  I feel it''s lacking in a little clarity, and you''ll probably get dinged for that a bit as the voting goes on.  I''m wondering if maybe there isn''t a little *too* much negative space however.</td>', 'A wonderful shot.  I feel it''s lacking in a little clarity, and you''ll probably get dinged for that a bit as the voting goes on.  I''m wondering if maybe there isn''t a little *too* much negative space however.', '2004-09-08 03:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
