(899311, 103884, 22011, '<td valign="top">Is this a scored filter, or just the lens flare?  Weird to get this effect when you''ve obviously stopped down a bit, and it looks like you''ve got a four bladed apeture in the lens.  If this isn''t a PS effect it''s a neat photo...  My fav. so far.</td>', 'Is this a scored filter, or just the lens flare?  Weird to get this effect when you''ve obviously stopped down a bit, and it looks like you''ve got a four bladed apeture in the lens.  If this isn''t a PS effect it''s a neat photo...  My fav. so far.', '2004-09-08 05:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
