(899320, 103552, 22011, '<td valign="top">Neat pet-shot..  A bit of ight in the eyes would make this so much better..  A bit of low level fill flash if your camera can, or a mirror if not...  Well caught.  6</td>', 'Neat pet-shot..  A bit of ight in the eyes would make this so much better..  A bit of low level fill flash if your camera can, or a mirror if not...  Well caught.  6', '2004-09-08 05:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
