(899322, 103964, 19952, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot because the light is really the subject of the photo, while not completely overpowering the woman. Very creative take on this challenge.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot because the light is really the subject of the photo, while not completely overpowering the woman. Very creative take on this challenge.', '2004-09-08 05:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
