(899338, 102699, 22011, '<td valign="top">ARRRGGGHHHHH!  It''s Woody again! :-).  A pair of well lit woody''s though...  I would have been taking the stands off them, they look a little odd with the bit of wire, well, you know...   The wire lasted about 5 minutes on the two I got a while ago.  6</td>', 'ARRRGGGHHHHH!  It''s Woody again! :-).  A pair of well lit woody''s though...  I would have been taking the stands off them, they look a little odd with the bit of wire, well, you know...   The wire lasted about 5 minutes on the two I got a while ago.  6', '2004-09-08 06:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
