(899341, 103590, 22011, '<td valign="top">I find the black across the top of frame a little distracting, would have prefered a fade to grey..  The shot is well composed, and the valve takes up jsut the right amount of the image for a solid 1/3rds layout.  7</td>', 'I find the black across the top of frame a little distracting, would have prefered a fade to grey..  The shot is well composed, and the valve takes up jsut the right amount of the image for a solid 1/3rds layout.  7', '2004-09-08 06:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
