(899351, 102357, 8643, '<td valign="top">Like the shapes, the curves, the contrasting sharp straight line, the semicircular shading, the balance.  Could have done without the big white border, it detracts.</td>', 'Like the shapes, the curves, the contrasting sharp straight line, the semicircular shading, the balance.  Could have done without the big white border, it detracts.', '2004-09-08 06:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(899353, 103724, 22011, '<td valign="top">What a neat landscape...  I won''t say what other folks have probably already said, but the light would appear to be comming from the front..  5, cause I like it. :-).</td>', 'What a neat landscape...  I won''t say what other folks have probably already said, but the light would appear to be comming from the front..  5, cause I like it. :-).', '2004-09-08 06:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(899354, 102743, 8643, '<td valign="top">Compelling - wonder why?  Hidden delights, perhaps.  Crisp and sparkly with nicely captured skin tones.</td>', 'Compelling - wonder why?  Hidden delights, perhaps.  Crisp and sparkly with nicely captured skin tones.', '2004-09-08 06:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(899355, 103892, 8643, '<td valign="top">Great fun, enjoyed this!</td>', 'Great fun, enjoyed this!', '2004-09-08 06:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(899358, 103502, 22011, '<td valign="top">It''s a little distracting that you''ve chopped of this poor fellow''s fingers, on both hands no less, but this image has great energy...  6</td>', 'It''s a little distracting that you''ve chopped of this poor fellow''s fingers, on both hands no less, but this image has great energy...  6', '2004-09-08 06:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(899362, 102357, 19952, '<td valign="top">Now when they said "backlighting"... :-) Seriously, this is a well conceived and executed photo with excellent lighting. My personal preference would be to make the subject larger and move it to the top left of the frame (essentially cropping out most of the black), but the way you''ve done it has a lot of interesting qualities as well. Nice job!</td>', 'Now when they said "backlighting"... :-) Seriously, this is a well conceived and executed photo with excellent lighting. My personal preference would be to make the subject larger and move it to the top left of the frame (essentially cropping out most of the black), but the way you''ve done it has a lot of interesting qualities as well. Nice job!', '2004-09-08 06:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(899363, 103876, 22011, '<td valign="top">Yes!  I didn''t enter in the end, but I was sooo tempted to take a back light photo.. :-).  And you''ve captured a back-lit back light.  Clever pose, B&amp;W + noise/grain give this a nice artsy feel.  7</td>', 'Yes!  I didn''t enter in the end, but I was sooo tempted to take a back light photo.. :-).  And you''ve captured a back-lit back light.  Clever pose, B&W + noise/grain give this a nice artsy feel.  7', '2004-09-08 06:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(899364, 102701, 22125, '<td valign="top">the fern behind is very distracting, otherwiseit is great, 6</td>', 'the fern behind is very distracting, otherwiseit is great, 6', '2004-09-08 06:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(899366, 103679, 19952, '<td valign="top">Too funny! Nice job placing the sun right behind the glass. I don''t usually like centered compositions so I would have moved the light out of the center, but this i a nice shot and a creative entry for this challenge. Good job!</td>', 'Too funny! Nice job placing the sun right behind the glass. I don''t usually like centered compositions so I would have moved the light out of the center, but this i a nice shot and a creative entry for this challenge. Good job!', '2004-09-08 06:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(899367, 102983, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice, rich colors and really interesting composition. It''s nice that you met the challenge without a glaring light in the photo. Good job!</td>', 'Nice, rich colors and really interesting composition. It''s nice that you met the challenge without a glaring light in the photo. Good job!', '2004-09-08 06:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(899368, 102177, 19952, '<td valign="top">Your girl''s a cutie! The shot would have been better without that person standing in the background, but it still came out well and with nice, soft backlighting. Good job.</td>', 'Your girl''s a cutie! The shot would have been better without that person standing in the background, but it still came out well and with nice, soft backlighting. Good job.', '2004-09-08 06:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
