(900047, 102726, 93, '<td valign="top">I love the use of the primary colors here.  The background you chose however, in my opinion,  is a little strong and tends to wash out the effect you were going for.  I think maybe a whiter background would have really clarified this shot and given it the "wow" factor it could have used.  Still, it''s a great idea, very nicely composed, and nicely lit.</td>', 'I love the use of the primary colors here.  The background you chose however, in my opinion,  is a little strong and tends to wash out the effect you were going for.  I think maybe a whiter background would have really clarified this shot and given it the "wow" factor it could have used.  Still, it''s a great idea, very nicely composed, and nicely lit.', '2004-09-08 15:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
