(900122, 102883, 17304, '<td valign="top">i like the idea...but i can'' t seem to find your point of focus...it seems fuzzy...also try changing backgrounds and light it more.</td>', 'i like the idea...but i can'' t seem to find your point of focus...it seems fuzzy...also try changing backgrounds and light it more.', '2004-09-08 15:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(900123, 103761, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice setup. The light greens complement the fabric.  I feel the lighting is just a little strong though, you might want to close the aperature down do deal with the burnout.  Focusing is a little soft, but that could be because of the heavy light.  It''s a very nice attempt, and keep practicing!</td>', 'Nice setup. The light greens complement the fabric.  I feel the lighting is just a little strong though, you might want to close the aperature down do deal with the burnout.  Focusing is a little soft, but that could be because of the heavy light.  It''s a very nice attempt, and keep practicing!', '2004-09-08 15:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(900124, 103733, 9452, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W works very well on this one, nice contrast.</td>', 'B&W works very well on this one, nice contrast.', '2004-09-08 15:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(900125, 102890, 20056, '<td valign="top">Simple and good; twice good :) 9</td>', 'Simple and good; twice good :) 9', '2004-09-08 15:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
