(900137, 102408, 17304, '<td valign="top">i think many would say the technical side of this photo is lacking...ie the disappearing arm...washed out head...but it works so well here in my opinion...i really like the directness of the subject...</td>', 'i think many would say the technical side of this photo is lacking...ie the disappearing arm...washed out head...but it works so well here in my opinion...i really like the directness of the subject...', '2004-09-08 15:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(900138, 103950, 93, '<td valign="top">The backlighting is visible, but a little to weak I think..  only the top part of the flower is really showing it, and your front lighting has overpowered it mostly.  A stronger source was needed for the back in order to make this a truly effective shot.  Or perhaps another back source to get more of the bottom half. Even if you were going for the effect of just having the top of the flower backlit, I think a stronger source of light would have helped. It''s just too soft for me.</td>', 'The backlighting is visible, but a little to weak I think..  only the top part of the flower is really showing it, and your front lighting has overpowered it mostly.  A stronger source was needed for the back in order to make this a truly effective shot.  Or perhaps another back source to get more of the bottom half. Even if you were going for the effect of just having the top of the flower backlit, I think a stronger source of light would have helped. It''s just too soft for me.', '2004-09-08 15:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(900140, 102143, 25655, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo! I just loved it! <br/>I wish you could lighten the palms just a bit though. I think they are too dark for this challenge :-(</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo! I just loved it! I wish you could lighten the palms just a bit though. I think they are too dark for this challenge :-(', '2004-09-08 15:32:04.000000', NULL, 1);
