(900157, 103380, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice job with getting the backlighting right.  The desaturation does help sell  the light source for me,  but there''s something just a little to plain about the overall composition.  Perhaps had you taken it with the player in an element of the game, it would have given the shot a little more life.</td>', 'Nice job with getting the backlighting right.  The desaturation does help sell  the light source for me,  but there''s something just a little to plain about the overall composition.  Perhaps had you taken it with the player in an element of the game, it would have given the shot a little more life.', '2004-09-08 15:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
