(900204, 102327, 10702, '<td valign="top">Not the best shot, the subject is boring, the lighting is way to hard and from a bad angle. It''s to blurry and the background is destracting.<br/>Now listen, I know this is harsh, but I''m just telling what I think is wrong for you to learn of it. I''m not writing this to make little of you. I always feel bad when I write comments like this so please, don''t take it the wrong way :)<br/>Just keep on going.</td>', 'Not the best shot, the subject is boring, the lighting is way to hard and from a bad angle. It''s to blurry and the background is destracting.Now listen, I know this is harsh, but I''m just telling what I think is wrong for you to learn of it. I''m not writing this to make little of you. I always feel bad when I write comments like this so please, don''t take it the wrong way :)Just keep on going.', '2004-09-08 16:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(900205, 103761, 13248, '<td valign="top">The actual subject looks underexposed to me...especially the grapes.</td>', 'The actual subject looks underexposed to me...especially the grapes.', '2004-09-08 16:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
