(900208, 102328, 10702, '<td valign="top">The Ipod is brilliant for this project because how the light comes of it. What I would want to see to make this shot great is a black bakcground and smaller spotlight and a tighter crop.</td>', 'The Ipod is brilliant for this project because how the light comes of it. What I would want to see to make this shot great is a black bakcground and smaller spotlight and a tighter crop.', '2004-09-08 16:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
