(900218, 103725, 13248, '<td valign="top">Love everything about this.  The lighting (although directional, and not backlighting) falls beautifully on your subject.</td>', 'Love everything about this.  The lighting (although directional, and not backlighting) falls beautifully on your subject.', '2004-09-08 16:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
