(900975, 103967, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nice light and subject.  I probably would have cropped it a bit.  The flowers around it are more distracting than adding to the shot.  Otherwise, nice.</td>', 'Nice light and subject.  I probably would have cropped it a bit.  The flowers around it are more distracting than adding to the shot.  Otherwise, nice.', '2004-09-08 22:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
