(900998, 103430, 26007, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped it tighter.  Whatever is on the right is out of focus and distracting.  Also the top has a lot of dead space.</td>', 'I would have cropped it tighter.  Whatever is on the right is out of focus and distracting.  Also the top has a lot of dead space.', '2004-09-08 22:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
