(901031, 102408, 26007, '<td valign="top">Kind of spooky.  It looks like you intentionally blew it out in Photoshop, though.  Would have been better if the backlighting had done it for you.  The lettering on the shirt is distracting.  So is his arm being up (behind his head?).</td>', 'Kind of spooky.  It looks like you intentionally blew it out in Photoshop, though.  Would have been better if the backlighting had done it for you.  The lettering on the shirt is distracting.  So is his arm being up (behind his head?).', '2004-09-08 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
