(901286, 102143, 25355, '<td valign="top">is more silhoutted than not, no detail in the palms</td>', 'is more silhoutted than not, no detail in the palms', '2004-09-09 01:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(901290, 102701, 18799, '<td valign="top">the title sucks   ;)<br/> <br/>Edit: Added smiley face - I''m not sure the the humorous intent came through <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-28 07:10:41.</i></td>', 'the title sucks   ;) Edit: Added smiley face - I''m not sure the the humorous intent came through ', '2004-09-09 01:52:16.000000', '2004-10-28 08:10:41.000000', 1),
(901292, 103909, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great catch!</td>', 'Great catch!', '2004-09-09 01:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(901293, 103743, 25355, '<td valign="top">nice silhouette</td>', 'nice silhouette', '2004-09-09 01:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(901296, 103453, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good use of negative space - unfortunately, the bull (as in your title) is is a silhouette and therefore doesn''t meet the challenge</td>', 'Nice photo, good use of negative space - unfortunately, the bull (as in your title) is is a silhouette and therefore doesn''t meet the challenge', '2004-09-09 01:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(901297, 103946, 671, '<td valign="top">exquisite color</td>', 'exquisite color', '2004-09-09 01:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(901298, 103701, 18799, '<td valign="top">When detail is lost, it becomes a silhouette, and doesn''t meet the challenge</td>', 'When detail is lost, it becomes a silhouette, and doesn''t meet the challenge', '2004-09-09 01:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(901301, 103998, 18799, '<td valign="top">Quite out of focus</td>', 'Quite out of focus', '2004-09-09 01:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(901306, 103590, 18799, '<td valign="top">Points for humor - not good humor, but humor none the less.  (kidding, it''s funny)<br/>Besides that, it''s a nice composition  8</td>', 'Points for humor - not good humor, but humor none the less.  (kidding, it''s funny)Besides that, it''s a nice composition  8', '2004-09-09 02:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(901310, 102645, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nice light and sharp subject.  Composition is a little spread out.  I think I would pick one or two of the fountains - perhaps the two on the right - and crop in tight on them.</td>', 'Nice light and sharp subject.  Composition is a little spread out.  I think I would pick one or two of the fountains - perhaps the two on the right - and crop in tight on them.', '2004-09-09 02:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(901314, 103716, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nice light.  Great subject.  I think I would have tried to avoiod chopping the heads off the birds in the back.  Perhaps you a crop could make it look less noticeable.  Nice photo though.</td>', 'Nice light.  Great subject.  I think I would have tried to avoiod chopping the heads off the birds in the back.  Perhaps you a crop could make it look less noticeable.  Nice photo though.', '2004-09-09 02:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(901315, 102611, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s great that it includes the shadow of the spider on the leaf. Extra points for that ;-)</td>', 'It''s great that it includes the shadow of the spider on the leaf. Extra points for that ;-)', '2004-09-09 02:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(901317, 103576, 26007, '<td valign="top">This is very grainy and flat in terms of contrast.  Photoshop might have been able to help with these.  This also looks fairly low resolution.  Was it cropped?  Or did you use a low resolution camera or setting?  Also, try experimenting with different exposure lengths and ISO settings might help too.</td>', 'This is very grainy and flat in terms of contrast.  Photoshop might have been able to help with these.  This also looks fairly low resolution.  Was it cropped?  Or did you use a low resolution camera or setting?  Also, try experimenting with different exposure lengths and ISO settings might help too.', '2004-09-09 02:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(901321, 103936, 26007, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a beer ad - I expect to see some big text on the right.  Light is nice.  Exposure is nice.  Reflection adds nice effect.  The subject is not very interesting, but nice from a technical perspective.</td>', 'Reminds me of a beer ad - I expect to see some big text on the right.  Light is nice.  Exposure is nice.  Reflection adds nice effect.  The subject is not very interesting, but nice from a technical perspective.', '2004-09-09 02:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(901322, 103723, 26007, '<td valign="top">The bottom half is very dark.  What happens if you brighten it up?  Maybe crop some of it out?  Play around with editing.  It has a potential, I just don''t think it''s quite there yet.</td>', 'The bottom half is very dark.  What happens if you brighten it up?  Maybe crop some of it out?  Play around with editing.  It has a potential, I just don''t think it''s quite there yet.', '2004-09-09 02:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(901323, 103508, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Very nice light and colors.  A little off center, but that isn''t necessarily bad.<br/></td>', 'Nicely composed.  Very nice light and colors.  A little off center, but that isn''t necessarily bad.', '2004-09-09 02:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(901324, 103949, 26007, '<td valign="top">Captured expression nicely.  Well composed.  It seems a little grainy, but not too bad.  I like it.</td>', 'Captured expression nicely.  Well composed.  It seems a little grainy, but not too bad.  I like it.', '2004-09-09 02:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(901326, 103455, 26007, '<td valign="top">Ooh, nice light and coloring.  Interesting off-beat composition.  Nice detail too.</td>', 'Ooh, nice light and coloring.  Interesting off-beat composition.  Nice detail too.', '2004-09-09 02:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(901327, 103282, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections.  A little dark.  I like the composition, though.</td>', 'Nice use of reflections.  A little dark.  I like the composition, though.', '2004-09-09 02:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(901328, 103665, 26007, '<td valign="top">I like the image.  Maybe would have liked to get a little moreof the tree branch at the top so it''s not chopped off, but it''s actually quite nice.  I don''t really see the backlighting, though.  Maybe I''m missing something(?)</td>', 'I like the image.  Maybe would have liked to get a little moreof the tree branch at the top so it''s not chopped off, but it''s actually quite nice.  I don''t really see the backlighting, though.  Maybe I''m missing something(?)', '2004-09-09 02:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(901329, 102351, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I might hidden the flame a bit more.  Also, could you have done it as a vertical?  Cropping it could acheive the same effect.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I might hidden the flame a bit more.  Also, could you have done it as a vertical?  Cropping it could acheive the same effect.', '2004-09-09 02:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(901331, 103253, 26007, '<td valign="top">I think I would crop this shot.</td>', 'I think I would crop this shot.', '2004-09-09 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(901333, 102276, 26007, '<td valign="top">I would have widened it a little - tried to get the whole flag and more of the flag pole.  Might also work to crop in tight to the sun spot as well.  Just some ideas.</td>', 'I would have widened it a little - tried to get the whole flag and more of the flag pole.  Might also work to crop in tight to the sun spot as well.  Just some ideas.', '2004-09-09 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(901334, 102895, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Nice light.  Might try cropping in a tiny bit on the right.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Nice light.  Might try cropping in a tiny bit on the right.', '2004-09-09 02:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(901337, 102795, 26007, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty cool effect.  I''d love to know how you did it.  :)</td>', 'That''s a pretty cool effect.  I''d love to know how you did it.  :)', '2004-09-09 02:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(901340, 102177, 26007, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture.  Nice portrait.  Very sharp.</td>', 'Very cute picture.  Nice portrait.  Very sharp.', '2004-09-09 02:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(901341, 103956, 26007, '<td valign="top">I think I''d try to crop out the finger.  Other than that, it''s nice.</td>', 'I think I''d try to crop out the finger.  Other than that, it''s nice.', '2004-09-09 02:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(901343, 102451, 25921, '<td valign="top">if i didn''t know the assignment was backlighting, i would say this is too dark.  but even given that, i think it is still too dark.  Nice effort though, looks like a good bit of work went into this one.</td>', 'if i didn''t know the assignment was backlighting, i would say this is too dark.  but even given that, i think it is still too dark.  Nice effort though, looks like a good bit of work went into this one.', '2004-09-09 02:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(901344, 103335, 26007, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think I''d crop it - tighten the focus on the boat.</td>', 'Nice, but I think I''d crop it - tighten the focus on the boat.', '2004-09-09 02:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(901345, 103427, 17503, '<td valign="top">good DOF, nice detail</td>', 'good DOF, nice detail', '2004-09-09 02:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(901346, 102143, 26007, '<td valign="top">silouette</td>', 'silouette', '2004-09-09 02:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(901348, 103453, 26007, '<td valign="top">silouette</td>', 'silouette', '2004-09-09 02:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(901349, 103589, 17503, '<td valign="top">very grainy, try upping your ISO speed. You could also edit the image and remove noise.</td>', 'very grainy, try upping your ISO speed. You could also edit the image and remove noise.', '2004-09-09 02:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(901351, 103905, 26007, '<td valign="top">The shadows are a little distracting, but overall nice.</td>', 'The shadows are a little distracting, but overall nice.', '2004-09-09 02:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(901352, 103927, 25921, '<td valign="top">For god''s sake, get that potato off the road before he gets mashed!!</td>', 'For god''s sake, get that potato off the road before he gets mashed!!', '2004-09-09 02:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(901353, 102732, 25921, '<td valign="top">The out of focus foreground obstructs the in focus background.  Which should I be looking at?</td>', 'The out of focus foreground obstructs the in focus background.  Which should I be looking at?', '2004-09-09 02:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(901354, 103743, 17503, '<td valign="top">um, silhouettes? the rules said not to use any....Great pic with lots of potential though...just an idea: crop vertically on the left of the pic....so maybe chop off the right 2-thirds of the photo. The powerlines are very distracting. Great colours though.</td>', 'um, silhouettes? the rules said not to use any....Great pic with lots of potential though...just an idea: crop vertically on the left of the pic....so maybe chop off the right 2-thirds of the photo. The powerlines are very distracting. Great colours though.', '2004-09-09 02:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(901355, 103590, 25921, '<td valign="top">I like this simplcity a lot.</td>', 'I like this simplcity a lot.', '2004-09-09 02:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(901356, 102962, 26007, '<td valign="top">I''d crop it tight on the spider.  But nice otherwise.</td>', 'I''d crop it tight on the spider.  But nice otherwise.', '2004-09-09 02:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(901357, 103956, 25921, '<td valign="top">is that a finger in the upper left corner?  out of place whatever it is.</td>', 'is that a finger in the upper left corner?  out of place whatever it is.', '2004-09-09 02:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(901358, 103543, 25921, '<td valign="top">great composition, nice separation with the background.  nicely done<br/></td>', 'great composition, nice separation with the background.  nicely done', '2004-09-09 02:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(901360, 103738, 26007, '<td valign="top">wish the focus was back a little - on the letters - or maybe a little more depth of field</td>', 'wish the focus was back a little - on the letters - or maybe a little more depth of field', '2004-09-09 02:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(901361, 103205, 17503, '<td valign="top">Well thats a great light hearted pic! Attack of the killer tree-toys!</td>', 'Well thats a great light hearted pic! Attack of the killer tree-toys!', '2004-09-09 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(901362, 103631, 25921, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure a simple sunset qualifies as backlighting.  still, nice sunset</td>', 'i''m not sure a simple sunset qualifies as backlighting.  still, nice sunset', '2004-09-09 02:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(901363, 102135, 26322, '<td valign="top">wow very good.Ni  camera baru ke camera pinjam.apa pun<br/>very nice picture...hope U enjoy with new camera</td>', 'wow very good.Ni  camera baru ke camera pinjam.apa punvery nice picture...hope U enjoy with new camera', '2004-09-09 02:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(901364, 103604, 17503, '<td valign="top">Isn''t playing with fire geat?!?! The smoke challenge is gonna be fun!</td>', 'Isn''t playing with fire geat?!?! The smoke challenge is gonna be fun!', '2004-09-09 02:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(901365, 103626, 25921, '<td valign="top">This comes across as a simple family snapshot I might develop a thousand a week of at the camera shop.  Sorry, but I find it lacking.</td>', 'This comes across as a simple family snapshot I might develop a thousand a week of at the camera shop.  Sorry, but I find it lacking.', '2004-09-09 02:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(901366, 102896, 26007, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I''d probably crop it in on the left a bit.</td>', 'Very nice.  I''d probably crop it in on the left a bit.', '2004-09-09 02:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(901367, 103914, 26007, '<td valign="top">This could be cropped a lot, I think.</td>', 'This could be cropped a lot, I think.', '2004-09-09 02:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(901371, 102940, 25921, '<td valign="top">nice find.</td>', 'nice find.', '2004-09-09 02:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(901372, 103821, 26322, '<td valign="top">cute baby foot...I like it....</td>', 'cute baby foot...I like it....', '2004-09-09 02:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(901375, 103082, 25921, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is the sort of hyperrealistic imagery your average joe thinks of when he ponders the evil hackers.  Well thought out and done.</td>', 'I''m sure this is the sort of hyperrealistic imagery your average joe thinks of when he ponders the evil hackers.  Well thought out and done.', '2004-09-09 02:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(901378, 103139, 25921, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-09-09 03:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(901380, 103936, 25921, '<td valign="top">not a compelling enough subject to capture my interest and hold it.  just my opinion.</td>', 'not a compelling enough subject to capture my interest and hold it.  just my opinion.', '2004-09-09 03:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(901381, 103876, 26007, '<td valign="top">kind of grainy and dark, but nice subject and composition.</td>', 'kind of grainy and dark, but nice subject and composition.', '2004-09-09 03:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(901382, 103047, 25921, '<td valign="top">this is very dark.  i can''t tell what i am looking at even with the title.</td>', 'this is very dark.  i can''t tell what i am looking at even with the title.', '2004-09-09 03:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(901387, 102983, 25921, '<td valign="top">would have like this better if i could see more of the lake.  or, given much of the foreground is sand, it would have been better with unblemished sand (not that you could pick up all the rocks without disturbing everything else, but there is just too much clutter detracting attention from the bright and colorful chair)</td>', 'would have like this better if i could see more of the lake.  or, given much of the foreground is sand, it would have been better with unblemished sand (not that you could pick up all the rocks without disturbing everything else, but there is just too much clutter detracting attention from the bright and colorful chair)', '2004-09-09 03:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(901388, 103702, 25921, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  One of the best I''ve seen so far.  Kudos to you.</td>', 'Excellent.  One of the best I''ve seen so far.  Kudos to you.', '2004-09-09 03:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(901389, 103723, 16241, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2004-09-09 03:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(901390, 103205, 25921, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Makes me chuckle if nothing else.</td>', 'Funny.  Makes me chuckle if nothing else.', '2004-09-09 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(901391, 103898, 25921, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2004-09-09 03:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(901392, 103151, 25921, '<td valign="top">i like the scene, but i find the composition has my attention competing too much from one place to another.</td>', 'i like the scene, but i find the composition has my attention competing too much from one place to another.', '2004-09-09 03:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(901394, 103680, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but your fore-lighting completely cancels out most of your backlighting.</td>', 'A nice idea, but your fore-lighting completely cancels out most of your backlighting.', '2004-09-09 03:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(901395, 103670, 93, '<td valign="top">I find that the sun completely overpowers this photograph, keeping your subject in too much of a silhouette and detracting from the composition.</td>', 'I find that the sun completely overpowers this photograph, keeping your subject in too much of a silhouette and detracting from the composition.', '2004-09-09 03:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(901397, 103668, 93, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Perhaps a litte soft on the source light, but you can clearly see it being backlit.  Colors are a *tad* dull to my eye, but the focus and exposure are nice.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Perhaps a litte soft on the source light, but you can clearly see it being backlit.  Colors are a *tad* dull to my eye, but the focus and exposure are nice.', '2004-09-09 03:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(901399, 103561, 93, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just a little over-exposed.. but good composition</td>', 'Perhaps just a little over-exposed.. but good composition', '2004-09-09 03:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(901401, 103723, 93, '<td valign="top">Good backlight, and you''ve used the flash to nice effect here.  Not sure about the cropping, but I don''t feel it takes too much away.  A good feel nonetheless.</td>', 'Good backlight, and you''ve used the flash to nice effect here.  Not sure about the cropping, but I don''t feel it takes too much away.  A good feel nonetheless.', '2004-09-09 03:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(901402, 103702, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a *great* example of backlighiting. I like that you''ve used the empty space to suggest a precipice that your subject is hanging over.  I liked this immediately on viewing.  The only thing I *don''t* like, is the heavy border. I don''t feel it was really necessary, and could have gotten away with a third of it''s thickness and been effective.</td>', 'This is a *great* example of backlighiting. I like that you''ve used the empty space to suggest a precipice that your subject is hanging over.  I liked this immediately on viewing.  The only thing I *don''t* like, is the heavy border. I don''t feel it was really necessary, and could have gotten away with a third of it''s thickness and been effective.', '2004-09-09 03:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(901404, 103970, 93, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a few Canadian music collection album covers I''ve seen.  The grain really helps sell this, and the autumn colors are very striking.  You''ve put together a very well-balanced piece.</td>', 'This reminds me of a few Canadian music collection album covers I''ve seen.  The grain really helps sell this, and the autumn colors are very striking.  You''ve put together a very well-balanced piece.', '2004-09-09 03:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(901407, 103576, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, but this piece falls short for a number of reasons, in my view.  Your brightness and contrast are quite flat. It adds no definition and makes it look like no real time or thought was put in to the photo.  The crop was a little too tight, and the sun just supplies no real "backlighting" because of its position. It seems to just wash out the one side.   I''d suggest experimenting more with exposure values, and/or, if you can, aperatures an shutter speeds.  Try and find one subject to focus on so that you get less general clutter in your shot,  and really just try to visualize something, then go and work on making it happen.  (A part that I still have major troubles with myself.)   I just thought that I''d help try and give you some pointers, as comments on my stuff early on really helped me.  Good luck!</td>', 'A nice concept, but this piece falls short for a number of reasons, in my view.  Your brightness and contrast are quite flat. It adds no definition and makes it look like no real time or thought was put in to the photo.  The crop was a little too tight, and the sun just supplies no real "backlighting" because of its position. It seems to just wash out the one side.   I''d suggest experimenting more with exposure values, and/or, if you can, aperatures an shutter speeds.  Try and find one subject to focus on so that you get less general clutter in your shot,  and really just try to visualize something, then go and work on making it happen.  (A part that I still have major troubles with myself.)   I just thought that I''d help try and give you some pointers, as comments on my stuff early on really helped me.  Good luck!', '2004-09-09 03:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(901408, 103205, 93, '<td valign="top">Hahaha.. this is very funny!  Your focus on the dactyl is a little soft, and noisy in my opinion, but I don''t know what I would have done to fix it.  Nice shot though, great creativity.</td>', 'Hahaha.. this is very funny!  Your focus on the dactyl is a little soft, and noisy in my opinion, but I don''t know what I would have done to fix it.  Nice shot though, great creativity.', '2004-09-09 03:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(901411, 102425, 93, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. The softness is a good choice, relaxing.  Wonderful exposure.</td>', 'I like this alot. The softness is a good choice, relaxing.  Wonderful exposure.', '2004-09-09 03:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
