(901618, 103458, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a big fan of flower shots, but this one is very good. Meets the challenge head on too. I surprised myself by giving  this a 10!</td>', 'I''m not really a big fan of flower shots, but this one is very good. Meets the challenge head on too. I surprised myself by giving  this a 10!', '2004-09-09 10:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(901626, 103997, 19841, '<td valign="top">I think a little different angle, to get the sun out of the picture, would have given you richer colors.   Also,  shallow depth of field has gotten half the flower out of focus.  It looks like you were trying to get the flower against the sky, but the darker background of grass and trees would have contrasted more with the backlit petals.<br/> <br/>You were trying for a tough one, and only missed by a little.  Keep taking pictures!</td>', 'I think a little different angle, to get the sun out of the picture, would have given you richer colors.   Also,  shallow depth of field has gotten half the flower out of focus.  It looks like you were trying to get the flower against the sky, but the darker background of grass and trees would have contrasted more with the backlit petals. You were trying for a tough one, and only missed by a little.  Keep taking pictures!', '2004-09-09 10:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(901629, 102319, 22517, '<td valign="top">Interesting and very intriguing, but what is it?</td>', 'Interesting and very intriguing, but what is it?', '2004-09-09 10:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(901630, 102346, 22517, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-09-09 10:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(901631, 102740, 19841, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is a gemstone of some sort.  The photo is hard to read, the backgound being particularly confusing.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is a gemstone of some sort.  The photo is hard to read, the backgound being particularly confusing.', '2004-09-09 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(901632, 103887, 14614, '<td valign="top">Interestingly different!  The color and light make this a photo I wanted to study a bit (hope your notes say how you did it)</td>', 'Interestingly different!  The color and light make this a photo I wanted to study a bit (hope your notes say how you did it)', '2004-09-09 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(901634, 103631, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo but I don''t feel it fits the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice photo but I don''t feel it fits the challenge.', '2004-09-09 10:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(901636, 103990, 14614, '<td valign="top">Tells a great story with the photo (a more vague title would let the viewer fill in his/her own blanks)  Just the right amount of light on the model''s face, perhaps cropped a bit tight on the bottom (althrough I know how that can be the only way sometimes)</td>', 'Tells a great story with the photo (a more vague title would let the viewer fill in his/her own blanks)  Just the right amount of light on the model''s face, perhaps cropped a bit tight on the bottom (althrough I know how that can be the only way sometimes)', '2004-09-09 10:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(901637, 103000, 24715, '<td valign="top">Too small, causes lack of detail.</td>', 'Too small, causes lack of detail.', '2004-09-09 10:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(901648, 102732, 24715, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but the fill light is taking too much away from the backlight. One may think it''s not backlighting at all.</td>', 'Cool shot, but the fill light is taking too much away from the backlight. One may think it''s not backlighting at all.', '2004-09-09 10:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
