(901679, 102023, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve told a great story with your title and shot.  to make this fine shot a bit better i''d like to see a bit more light on the model''s left to pull her away from the background a bit.  overall very well done - good use of B&amp;W and i like the blown out windows as they''ve lost detail and have me focus on the model - the furniture thing anchors the foreground.</td>', 'you''ve told a great story with your title and shot.  to make this fine shot a bit better i''d like to see a bit more light on the model''s left to pull her away from the background a bit.  overall very well done - good use of B&W and i like the blown out windows as they''ve lost detail and have me focus on the model - the furniture thing anchors the foreground.', '2004-09-09 11:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(901680, 102106, 14614, '<td valign="top">got me to study this one -- thanks for showing a creative side... b&amp;w is a good choice - centered composition works.</td>', 'got me to study this one -- thanks for showing a creative side... b&w is a good choice - centered composition works.', '2004-09-09 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
