(902367, 103206, 24065, '<td valign="top">I tried a bunch of photos of things on my lightbox, too, but abandoned them.  I didn''t like the way the light faded around the edges instead of leaving a crisp, white background.  I also found that it was difficult to get a sharp focus on the lightbox -- can''t explain why.  That''s not to say that what I did enter is doing all that well, either, but ... just to let you know why I didn''t vote your photo highter ;-)</td>', 'I tried a bunch of photos of things on my lightbox, too, but abandoned them.  I didn''t like the way the light faded around the edges instead of leaving a crisp, white background.  I also found that it was difficult to get a sharp focus on the lightbox -- can''t explain why.  That''s not to say that what I did enter is doing all that well, either, but ... just to let you know why I didn''t vote your photo highter ;-)', '2004-09-09 20:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
