(902623, 103338, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>I roo was going for a similar shot. This is soothing and taking full advantage of the baclight to use the transparant nature of the subject to light the foreground.</td>', 'returning for commentsI roo was going for a similar shot. This is soothing and taking full advantage of the baclight to use the transparant nature of the subject to light the foreground.', '2004-09-09 22:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
