(902676, 103548, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>The placement of the backlight could have been improved. The ideal is the light along the thighs. The light in the forearm eats up too much. A way to think about this is the zone system. The backlight comes in between 9 and 10th zone, mostly ten. This means it will burn out all definition. Since the flesh is in the 5, you only want a bead of light around the image. Bumping image for good composition.</td>', 'returning for commentsThe placement of the backlight could have been improved. The ideal is the light along the thighs. The light in the forearm eats up too much. A way to think about this is the zone system. The backlight comes in between 9 and 10th zone, mostly ten. This means it will burn out all definition. Since the flesh is in the 5, you only want a bead of light around the image. Bumping image for good composition.', '2004-09-09 23:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
