(902741, 103702, 22046, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how a snail can be elegant but this one is. The shapes and the quality of light make this one special. One of my few 10s for this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure how a snail can be elegant but this one is. The shapes and the quality of light make this one special. One of my few 10s for this challenge.', '2004-09-10 00:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
