(902744, 103982, 22046, '<td valign="top">Aha! Finally a really interesting leaf sillhouette. The colors and the way you chose to crop this make it stand out. I wish the lower right portion were in sharp focus like most of the rest. Still it is a 9 in my book.</td>', 'Aha! Finally a really interesting leaf sillhouette. The colors and the way you chose to crop this make it stand out. I wish the lower right portion were in sharp focus like most of the rest. Still it is a 9 in my book.', '2004-09-10 00:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(902746, 103139, 24065, '<td valign="top">Is this bee dead???? No fair!!   You should be out there chasing the live ones with the rest of us! ;-) But I do love the colors, the sharpness, and the use of negative and positive space in the composition.  You should place well.</td>', 'Is this bee dead???? No fair!!   You should be out there chasing the live ones with the rest of us! ;-) But I do love the colors, the sharpness, and the use of negative and positive space in the composition.  You should place well.', '2004-09-10 00:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(902747, 102744, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of light to make a moving portrait. There is an air of mystery about this... what is she thinking? Is she sad or just pensive? Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful use of light to make a moving portrait. There is an air of mystery about this... what is she thinking? Is she sad or just pensive? Well done.', '2004-09-10 00:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902749, 103968, 22046, '<td valign="top">Clever idea well executed. Love the colors against the backlit white background. The sharp focus makes it work.</td>', 'Clever idea well executed. Love the colors against the backlit white background. The sharp focus makes it work.', '2004-09-10 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(902750, 102896, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.  I like the coloring of yours much better than the one I entered!  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.  I like the coloring of yours much better than the one I entered!  Good luck!', '2004-09-10 00:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(902752, 103749, 22046, '<td valign="top">Love all the patterns these lime slices make. Good subject well taken.</td>', 'Love all the patterns these lime slices make. Good subject well taken.', '2004-09-10 00:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(902753, 103643, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing photograph -- good composition.</td>', 'Very pleasing photograph -- good composition.', '2004-09-10 00:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(902756, 103673, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the little spider web on the end of one branch.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the little spider web on the end of one branch.', '2004-09-10 00:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(902760, 103935, 93, '<td valign="top">Here''s a photograph that I think is absolutely stunning, but I can guess that you''re probably getting hit a little hard in the voting because "It''s a silhouette!" Am I right? hehe.  Not me. The bottle is silhouetted, true, but that''s not the subject. Your subject is the splash of water, which is *very* beautifully enhanced by the lighting in this, and not at all silhoutted.   Composition is strong, leading you from one side of the photograph with the strong dark bottle top, to the other end through the flow of water.  My two gripes with this is that it looks a little over-smoothed, and the exposure is perhaps a little high (could use less flash in the sparkling highlights).  However, a beautiful photograph, a great example of backlighting, and one of the better shots (IMO) of the challenge. Congrats.</td>', 'Here''s a photograph that I think is absolutely stunning, but I can guess that you''re probably getting hit a little hard in the voting because "It''s a silhouette!" Am I right? hehe.  Not me. The bottle is silhouetted, true, but that''s not the subject. Your subject is the splash of water, which is *very* beautifully enhanced by the lighting in this, and not at all silhoutted.   Composition is strong, leading you from one side of the photograph with the strong dark bottle top, to the other end through the flow of water.  My two gripes with this is that it looks a little over-smoothed, and the exposure is perhaps a little high (could use less flash in the sparkling highlights).  However, a beautiful photograph, a great example of backlighting, and one of the better shots (IMO) of the challenge. Congrats.', '2004-09-10 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(902761, 103151, 22046, '<td valign="top">The colored light from the side really makes this special. It is more side lit than back lit but still the window at the top is beind the cross so I won''t quibble. Nice work.</td>', 'The colored light from the side really makes this special. It is more side lit than back lit but still the window at the top is beind the cross so I won''t quibble. Nice work.', '2004-09-10 00:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(902762, 104002, 93, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the color shifting that was done here.. It takes too much attention from the fact that it''s backlit, and makes it look more like a well colored painting.</td>', 'I personally don''t like the color shifting that was done here.. It takes too much attention from the fact that it''s backlit, and makes it look more like a well colored painting.', '2004-09-10 00:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(902764, 102450, 22046, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Makes for a nice abstract.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Makes for a nice abstract.', '2004-09-10 00:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(902765, 104001, 93, '<td valign="top">Too much frontal lighting ruins any backlighting effect.</td>', 'Too much frontal lighting ruins any backlighting effect.', '2004-09-10 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(902768, 102425, 22046, '<td valign="top">So simple and so effective.</td>', 'So simple and so effective.', '2004-09-10 00:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(902770, 103919, 93, '<td valign="top">I feel the lack of focus hurts this photograph, and that lack of clarity also makes it hard to determine the source of light.  This may be backlit, but it''s just too hard to determine *what* it is, what the focal point should be,  and what this photograph is all about.</td>', 'I feel the lack of focus hurts this photograph, and that lack of clarity also makes it hard to determine the source of light.  This may be backlit, but it''s just too hard to determine *what* it is, what the focal point should be,  and what this photograph is all about.', '2004-09-10 00:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902771, 103885, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and composition. The sharp focus makes this work very well.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and composition. The sharp focus makes this work very well.', '2004-09-10 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(902774, 103537, 22046, '<td valign="top">A+ for clever idea. Also a good job of making it happen. I''d like to be able to see the metal part just a bit more definedly but this is a nit... Well done.</td>', 'A+ for clever idea. Also a good job of making it happen. I''d like to be able to see the metal part just a bit more definedly but this is a nit... Well done.', '2004-09-10 00:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(902776, 103153, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a nice piece in my opinion.  Focus is a touch soft for me, but the backlighting is very evident, and I love the little trail of fluid.  I would suggest that maybe a kidney bean, or some other type of prop be used on the left side of the tomato to give the subject more of a "snail" appearance.</td>', 'This is a nice piece in my opinion.  Focus is a touch soft for me, but the backlighting is very evident, and I love the little trail of fluid.  I would suggest that maybe a kidney bean, or some other type of prop be used on the left side of the tomato to give the subject more of a "snail" appearance.', '2004-09-10 00:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(902779, 103641, 22046, '<td valign="top">Not the first of these I''ve seen... hence your title... I like your choice of colors and your decision to make the field behind the glasses quite large with the light dropping off at the outside. This works excellently.</td>', 'Not the first of these I''ve seen... hence your title... I like your choice of colors and your decision to make the field behind the glasses quite large with the light dropping off at the outside. This works excellently.', '2004-09-10 00:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(902781, 103577, 93, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this for a few minutes, because at first glance, the light seems to be coming from the front of the subject.. but then, if you study the shadows, you realize it isn''t.  Still, it is coming in from a more frontal-side than *back*, and that''ll probably hurt you in the long run.   I like your composition in this. It''s almost like a city scape of flora. The colors are very nice as well.</td>', 'I had to look at this for a few minutes, because at first glance, the light seems to be coming from the front of the subject.. but then, if you study the shadows, you realize it isn''t.  Still, it is coming in from a more frontal-side than *back*, and that''ll probably hurt you in the long run.   I like your composition in this. It''s almost like a city scape of flora. The colors are very nice as well.', '2004-09-10 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(902784, 102668, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the off center composition of this. Also the light does a wonderful job of defining the jar and the plant.</td>', 'I like the off center composition of this. Also the light does a wonderful job of defining the jar and the plant.', '2004-09-10 00:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(902786, 103715, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light.</td>', 'Excellent use of light.', '2004-09-10 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(902787, 103575, 25828, '<td valign="top">nice exposure of foreground and background. 9</td>', 'nice exposure of foreground and background. 9', '2004-09-10 00:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(902788, 102807, 93, '<td valign="top">This shot is definitely backlit, but I think it suffers because of a lack of decent lighting, focus, and composition.  I find it too dark in the bottom half, and cropped far too closely at the top.  Also, the subject is a little "plain" for lack of a better word, and you''ll find that it''s probably uninteresting to many.  Keep trying though.</td>', 'This shot is definitely backlit, but I think it suffers because of a lack of decent lighting, focus, and composition.  I find it too dark in the bottom half, and cropped far too closely at the top.  Also, the subject is a little "plain" for lack of a better word, and you''ll find that it''s probably uninteresting to many.  Keep trying though.', '2004-09-10 00:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(902790, 103909, 22046, '<td valign="top">Omigosh! How did you get this one? I love that the focus is so good you can see the feathers on his back. My only complaint is that the background is a bit busy. I know you couldn''t blur it in this challenge but you might want to do that for future uses of this image. It has so much potential for use in other settings.</td>', 'Omigosh! How did you get this one? I love that the focus is so good you can see the feathers on his back. My only complaint is that the background is a bit busy. I know you couldn''t blur it in this challenge but you might want to do that for future uses of this image. It has so much potential for use in other settings.', '2004-09-10 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(902792, 103565, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like the sun where it is or not.  Great example of backlighting, a wonderfully posed profile (good emotion), and great composition.  I don''t like the yellow tint, but that''s just personal preference.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like the sun where it is or not.  Great example of backlighting, a wonderfully posed profile (good emotion), and great composition.  I don''t like the yellow tint, but that''s just personal preference.', '2004-09-10 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(902794, 103988, 22046, '<td valign="top">Love that yellow and green!</td>', 'Love that yellow and green!', '2004-09-10 00:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(902795, 102983, 22046, '<td valign="top">Summer is over. The sun is lower in the sky. The light comes in at a lower angle. Time to put away the toys of summer and get back to work or school. This picture says all this to me. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Summer is over. The sun is lower in the sky. The light comes in at a lower angle. Time to put away the toys of summer and get back to work or school. This picture says all this to me. Excellent composition.', '2004-09-10 00:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(902796, 102023, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m surpised that there haven''t been more entries like this one.  A great example of backlighting.  My suggestion would be to cut down the exposure slightly, and crop in closer on the girl. I see too much door here, and it hurts the piece. Also, the stool adds nothing but distraction.  It''s a great moment, so keep shooting, and see what you can come up with in the future :)</td>', 'I''m surpised that there haven''t been more entries like this one.  A great example of backlighting.  My suggestion would be to cut down the exposure slightly, and crop in closer on the girl. I see too much door here, and it hurts the piece. Also, the stool adds nothing but distraction.  It''s a great moment, so keep shooting, and see what you can come up with in the future :)', '2004-09-10 00:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(902797, 102143, 93, '<td valign="top">The lens flare in this photograph really detracts from the shot for me.  Also, (even with my monitor brightness and contrast up), it''s still far too silhouetted.</td>', 'The lens flare in this photograph really detracts from the shot for me.  Also, (even with my monitor brightness and contrast up), it''s still far too silhouetted.', '2004-09-10 00:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(902798, 103547, 22046, '<td valign="top">Keep wondering what this is... but whatever I really like it.</td>', 'Keep wondering what this is... but whatever I really like it.', '2004-09-10 00:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(902800, 103761, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this is exceptional except for the dark space in the upper left.  A distracting glare or shadow appears there.</td>', 'I think this is exceptional except for the dark space in the upper left.  A distracting glare or shadow appears there.', '2004-09-10 00:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(902803, 103725, 93, '<td valign="top">This is truly a gorgeous photograph. The backlighting works wonderfully well, the subject is dark, but details can still be seen (and I use a pretty dark monitor), and the pose is fantastic. The sepia tone was a great choice as well. Great job.</td>', 'This is truly a gorgeous photograph. The backlighting works wonderfully well, the subject is dark, but details can still be seen (and I use a pretty dark monitor), and the pose is fantastic. The sepia tone was a great choice as well. Great job.', '2004-09-10 00:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(902804, 103819, 25773, '<td valign="top">This isn''t looking like backlit (not a shadow of the butterfly on the flower). Otherwise a gorgeous picture!</td>', 'This isn''t looking like backlit (not a shadow of the butterfly on the flower). Otherwise a gorgeous picture!', '2004-09-10 00:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902808, 103822, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is very nice and different.  I think the focuse needed to be a bit sharper.</td>', 'This is very nice and different.  I think the focuse needed to be a bit sharper.', '2004-09-10 00:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(902809, 103719, 93, '<td valign="top">I like this, with a few minor suggestions.  I think a looser crop at the top of the head would have been a better idea.  The pose is good, but the child''s face lacks a certain emotion (this is tough though.. I know!).  Other than that, it''s a great backlighting shot, and a wonderful idea.</td>', 'I like this, with a few minor suggestions.  I think a looser crop at the top of the head would have been a better idea.  The pose is good, but the child''s face lacks a certain emotion (this is tough though.. I know!).  Other than that, it''s a great backlighting shot, and a wonderful idea.', '2004-09-10 00:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(902810, 102804, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and nice photo.  The composition is a bit boring with the bird almost perfectly centered, and the focus could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea, and nice photo.  The composition is a bit boring with the bird almost perfectly centered, and the focus could be a bit sharper.', '2004-09-10 00:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(902813, 103426, 25464, '<td valign="top">I love the rich color and the crisp focus.  Good example of backlighting.</td>', 'I love the rich color and the crisp focus.  Good example of backlighting.', '2004-09-10 00:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902814, 103752, 25464, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. Nice lighting and detail.  Great expression and title to tie it all up.  Good job.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. Nice lighting and detail.  Great expression and title to tie it all up.  Good job.', '2004-09-10 00:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(902816, 102398, 25464, '<td valign="top">A little too surreal for my taste, but just personal preference.  Very good example of backlighting, original, and well taken.</td>', 'A little too surreal for my taste, but just personal preference.  Very good example of backlighting, original, and well taken.', '2004-09-10 00:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(902818, 103908, 93, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful.. but the only things that *aren''t* silhouetted are the cranes.</td>', 'This is quite beautiful.. but the only things that *aren''t* silhouetted are the cranes.', '2004-09-10 00:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(902820, 102135, 25464, '<td valign="top">I love the feeling of this photo, but the color/lighting is way too harsh.  If this could have been taken in evening or early morning light it would have been a great shot.</td>', 'I love the feeling of this photo, but the color/lighting is way too harsh.  If this could have been taken in evening or early morning light it would have been a great shot.', '2004-09-10 00:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(902828, 103948, 93, '<td valign="top">Not entirely a sihouette, but a little too much so to truly stay in the challenge description.  A fill-in flash may have helped if it was powerful enough, or a reflector. Backlit shots on the water are really tough.</td>', 'Not entirely a sihouette, but a little too much so to truly stay in the challenge description.  A fill-in flash may have helped if it was powerful enough, or a reflector. Backlit shots on the water are really tough.', '2004-09-10 01:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(902832, 103761, 26162, '<td valign="top">The darkness of the upper left corner is drawing my eye away from the subject, but I like the green of the grapes w/ the green of the bottle.</td>', 'The darkness of the upper left corner is drawing my eye away from the subject, but I like the green of the grapes w/ the green of the bottle.', '2004-09-10 01:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
