(902982, 102794, 23016, '<td valign="top">In my opinion there is no backlight enhacing the value of the subject, there is a diffuse lighting! Nice object and good focus.<br/>- UPDATE: I was wrong with my backlighting idea, it should not be a direct source. This was one of my first votes in this challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion there is no backlight enhacing the value of the subject, there is a diffuse lighting! Nice object and good focus.- UPDATE: I was wrong with my backlighting idea, it should not be a direct source. This was one of my first votes in this challenge.', '2004-09-10 05:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(902986, 102537, 16004, '<td valign="top">looks like a horticultural version of the opening to any james bond film!  i like this greatly though - the greens are luminous, the detail is nice and sharp (althugh a little is lost in the lower left hand corner - which also looks moderately discoloured from the rest) and i like how you SCOFF at the rule of thirds having the centre stem all the way over to one side - choice of composition is very nice indeed.  fits the challenge, and is a viable hang-on-the-wall image.  8.</td>', 'looks like a horticultural version of the opening to any james bond film!  i like this greatly though - the greens are luminous, the detail is nice and sharp (althugh a little is lost in the lower left hand corner - which also looks moderately discoloured from the rest) and i like how you SCOFF at the rule of thirds having the centre stem all the way over to one side - choice of composition is very nice indeed.  fits the challenge, and is a viable hang-on-the-wall image.  8.', '2004-09-10 05:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(902990, 103625, 16004, '<td valign="top">in terms of choice of materials, i think this is pretty good.  the problems for me lies in location of the shot, and the angle of the shot.  the camera is not in the best position here - if it were more to the left and more head-on then i think the shot would look better straighter.  true, that would mean falling in to some level of conformity, which gives you a blander shot...  but the window frame at such an angle is a major distraction.  also, the lace net curtain, which i''m afraid is not often very photogenic.  try a cheap sheet of perspex, or indeed a white sheet - either of which would have made the background a little less messy.  the vase on the left is very pretty, and the transluscent appearance is very effective.  it certainly fits the challenge, but really on a set-up like this, less is more.  just one vase and a plain background might be worth playing with for a bit. 4.</td>', 'in terms of choice of materials, i think this is pretty good.  the problems for me lies in location of the shot, and the angle of the shot.  the camera is not in the best position here - if it were more to the left and more head-on then i think the shot would look better straighter.  true, that would mean falling in to some level of conformity, which gives you a blander shot...  but the window frame at such an angle is a major distraction.  also, the lace net curtain, which i''m afraid is not often very photogenic.  try a cheap sheet of perspex, or indeed a white sheet - either of which would have made the background a little less messy.  the vase on the left is very pretty, and the transluscent appearance is very effective.  it certainly fits the challenge, but really on a set-up like this, less is more.  just one vase and a plain background might be worth playing with for a bit. 4.', '2004-09-10 05:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(902994, 103964, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a very lovely photograph.  i love the colours and the lighting - the whole thing is steeped in feeling and ideas.  thoughts of iconic images of the early seventies comes to mind, and is strangely evocative of France, for some reason.  the only thing i would add is that your model might have tried smiling a little bit - not madly but have at least a bit of a grin - all the sinshine and warm colours should really be with a happier sense of feeling, but maybe that''s just me.  still, a captivating (challenge fitting) shot.  well done.  9.</td>', 'this is a very lovely photograph.  i love the colours and the lighting - the whole thing is steeped in feeling and ideas.  thoughts of iconic images of the early seventies comes to mind, and is strangely evocative of France, for some reason.  the only thing i would add is that your model might have tried smiling a little bit - not madly but have at least a bit of a grin - all the sinshine and warm colours should really be with a happier sense of feeling, but maybe that''s just me.  still, a captivating (challenge fitting) shot.  well done.  9.', '2004-09-10 05:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(902996, 102271, 21158, '<td valign="top">such a wonderful panoramic shot.  meets challenge, not overexposed,  good job. 9</td>', 'such a wonderful panoramic shot.  meets challenge, not overexposed,  good job. 9', '2004-09-10 06:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(902998, 102744, 21158, '<td valign="top">excellent use of light.  very good exposure,   the contrast is superb.  B&amp;W really makes this pic stand out.  meets challenge, great exposure, wow factor, tops   10</td>', 'excellent use of light.  very good exposure,   the contrast is superb.  B&W really makes this pic stand out.  meets challenge, great exposure, wow factor, tops   10', '2004-09-10 06:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(902999, 103379, 16004, '<td valign="top">i shouldn''t like this, i should be bored rigid.  a shirt?  on a washing line?  pbblffft!  BUT, i am drawn to it, intrigued and i find this visually very appealling.  the bits of fauna at the very very top are a little distracting, and i''m in two minds about the dark clothing on the right - i think more sky in this portion might have been slightly preferable.  but i like muchly the angle of the shot, the dramatic use of greys and blues, and basically your whole brazen and audacious confidence of submitting a shot of your washing line!  go you!  8.</td>', 'i shouldn''t like this, i should be bored rigid.  a shirt?  on a washing line?  pbblffft!  BUT, i am drawn to it, intrigued and i find this visually very appealling.  the bits of fauna at the very very top are a little distracting, and i''m in two minds about the dark clothing on the right - i think more sky in this portion might have been slightly preferable.  but i like muchly the angle of the shot, the dramatic use of greys and blues, and basically your whole brazen and audacious confidence of submitting a shot of your washing line!  go you!  8.', '2004-09-10 06:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(903000, 102349, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a strange choice of subject, and by not having something even moderately  translucent in the shot i think is somewhat a disadvantage to you.  doesn''t really yell "lit from the back" to me...  sorry.</td>', 'it''s a strange choice of subject, and by not having something even moderately  translucent in the shot i think is somewhat a disadvantage to you.  doesn''t really yell "lit from the back" to me...  sorry.', '2004-09-10 06:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(903002, 102163, 16004, '<td valign="top">monkey!  awww!  so cute!  and a very nice shot too!  the lighting certainly adds to the shot too - i love the way the edge of fur is illuminated.  only slight slight minutest reservation is that i think the little guy fills the frame a teeny tiny bit too much.  but that''s a stupid thing to comment on, so 10 it is.  awww!</td>', 'monkey!  awww!  so cute!  and a very nice shot too!  the lighting certainly adds to the shot too - i love the way the edge of fur is illuminated.  only slight slight minutest reservation is that i think the little guy fills the frame a teeny tiny bit too much.  but that''s a stupid thing to comment on, so 10 it is.  awww!', '2004-09-10 06:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(903003, 103475, 21158, '<td valign="top">a little bit of flare on the face and back of neck otherwise a good pic</td>', 'a little bit of flare on the face and back of neck otherwise a good pic', '2004-09-10 06:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(903004, 103766, 21158, '<td valign="top">a little soft focus on upper leaf.</td>', 'a little soft focus on upper leaf.', '2004-09-10 06:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(903005, 102026, 21158, '<td valign="top">too much sky and not enough subject</td>', 'too much sky and not enough subject', '2004-09-10 06:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(903006, 103546, 21158, '<td valign="top">clouds look harsh (washed out).</td>', 'clouds look harsh (washed out).', '2004-09-10 06:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(903007, 103906, 21158, '<td valign="top">soft on right side</td>', 'soft on right side', '2004-09-10 06:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(903008, 102328, 16004, '<td valign="top">not sure it strictly fits the challenge, or at least doesn''t suggest especially that''s it''s been lit from behind.  more on top really.  also, i always felt the ipod looks better without the stand and even the headphone lead - mush less cluttered that way.  angle of position of the camera needs lowering - i suspect a more straight-on image might reduce the swelling of the sides of the main subject.  also, focus seems to be on the grain of the table, rather than the ipod.</td>', 'not sure it strictly fits the challenge, or at least doesn''t suggest especially that''s it''s been lit from behind.  more on top really.  also, i always felt the ipod looks better without the stand and even the headphone lead - mush less cluttered that way.  angle of position of the camera needs lowering - i suspect a more straight-on image might reduce the swelling of the sides of the main subject.  also, focus seems to be on the grain of the table, rather than the ipod.', '2004-09-10 06:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(903009, 102873, 21158, '<td valign="top">too soft</td>', 'too soft', '2004-09-10 06:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(903010, 103875, 21158, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2004-09-10 06:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(903011, 102650, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit silhouettey, and you might get marked down a bit for that.  as a shot without challenge considerations, it''s a very attractive landscape picture.  i don''t know how big the original shot was, but i think youmight have considered cropping off the lower half - there just seems to be a bit too much water and dark indistinguishable bank.  the sky is fantastic, the clouds especially cool as they appear to be emanating from the sun.  it''s a shame that portion of the shot (trees and sky and reflection) forms a small part of the overall composition.  6.</td>', 'it''s a bit silhouettey, and you might get marked down a bit for that.  as a shot without challenge considerations, it''s a very attractive landscape picture.  i don''t know how big the original shot was, but i think youmight have considered cropping off the lower half - there just seems to be a bit too much water and dark indistinguishable bank.  the sky is fantastic, the clouds especially cool as they appear to be emanating from the sun.  it''s a shame that portion of the shot (trees and sky and reflection) forms a small part of the overall composition.  6.', '2004-09-10 06:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(903013, 102697, 21158, '<td valign="top">hair or fishing line across the back?? nice body colors</td>', 'hair or fishing line across the back?? nice body colors', '2004-09-10 06:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(903014, 103719, 25017, '<td valign="top">what an angel, gold spun hair backlighted and an angelic expression, lovely! 9 I wish she had on a nice crips cotton top or something a bit too much skin showing</td>', 'what an angel, gold spun hair backlighted and an angelic expression, lovely! 9 I wish she had on a nice crips cotton top or something a bit too much skin showing', '2004-09-10 06:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(903016, 103609, 21158, '<td valign="top">good detail</td>', 'good detail', '2004-09-10 06:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(903017, 103458, 21158, '<td valign="top">center of flower lost detail</td>', 'center of flower lost detail', '2004-09-10 06:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(903019, 103186, 16004, '<td valign="top">slightly mad, but i like it lots.  the red background works very effectively, but i am in two minds about the pot - something so huge and solid either overwhelms or nicely compliments the shot, and i have no idea which it is.  i think by the way you''ve cropped, it''s probably the latter.  this is a brilliant very likeable and original picture, and humourous too.  8.</td>', 'slightly mad, but i like it lots.  the red background works very effectively, but i am in two minds about the pot - something so huge and solid either overwhelms or nicely compliments the shot, and i have no idea which it is.  i think by the way you''ve cropped, it''s probably the latter.  this is a brilliant very likeable and original picture, and humourous too.  8.', '2004-09-10 07:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(903021, 102349, 21158, '<td valign="top">meets challenge, good exposure, just a little noise.</td>', 'meets challenge, good exposure, just a little noise.', '2004-09-10 07:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(903022, 103998, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice architexture. good pic.</td>', 'nice architexture. good pic.', '2004-09-10 07:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(903023, 103819, 21158, '<td valign="top">great macro. wonderful colors</td>', 'great macro. wonderful colors', '2004-09-10 07:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(903024, 102346, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2004-09-10 07:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(903028, 103745, 24486, '<td valign="top">This would of been great in the framed challenge.</td>', 'This would of been great in the framed challenge.', '2004-09-10 07:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(903029, 103604, 21158, '<td valign="top">like the flame</td>', 'like the flame', '2004-09-10 07:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(903033, 103725, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good use of cropping &amp; B&amp;W</td>', 'Good use of cropping & B&W', '2004-09-10 07:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(903034, 103256, 8005, '<td valign="top">Stop it. You''re scaring me ;-)</td>', 'Stop it. You''re scaring me ;-)', '2004-09-10 07:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(903036, 102205, 24486, '<td valign="top">Clever concept</td>', 'Clever concept', '2004-09-10 07:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(903089, 102686, 19982, '<td valign="top">For me, the blown highlights in the face kind of ruin the picture.  If you could have at least kept an outline of his face, I think it would have worked better.</td>', 'For me, the blown highlights in the face kind of ruin the picture.  If you could have at least kept an outline of his face, I think it would have worked better.', '2004-09-10 09:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(903121, 103899, 22864, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this would be better if it were even more unbalanced.  Pincushion distortion visible at the top.  Sure is backlit!</td>', 'I wonder if this would be better if it were even more unbalanced.  Pincushion distortion visible at the top.  Sure is backlit!', '2004-09-10 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(903123, 102803, 22864, '<td valign="top">Too many elements - eye can''t settle.</td>', 'Too many elements - eye can''t settle.', '2004-09-10 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(903124, 103981, 22864, '<td valign="top">Kind of ugly, but interesting and unusual</td>', 'Kind of ugly, but interesting and unusual', '2004-09-10 10:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(903127, 102174, 22864, '<td valign="top">The rules call for no silouettes!</td>', 'The rules call for no silouettes!', '2004-09-10 10:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(903130, 103256, 22864, '<td valign="top">He''s top lit, not backlit.</td>', 'He''s top lit, not backlit.', '2004-09-10 10:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(903132, 103773, 19841, '<td valign="top">A tad dark, but otherwise very well done.</td>', 'A tad dark, but otherwise very well done.', '2004-09-10 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(903133, 103057, 22864, '<td valign="top">As somebody told me on the last contest, it would have been better with a blue sky.</td>', 'As somebody told me on the last contest, it would have been better with a blue sky.', '2004-09-10 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(903137, 102686, 22864, '<td valign="top">He''s faceless!</td>', 'He''s faceless!', '2004-09-10 10:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(903141, 102840, 21554, '<td valign="top">The little critter is a little dark.  Would have liked to see a bit of his expression.  But the halos on the grass seed heads is wonderful.</td>', 'The little critter is a little dark.  Would have liked to see a bit of his expression.  But the halos on the grass seed heads is wonderful.', '2004-09-10 10:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(903142, 103887, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is odd, scary, bizarre and very interesting.  it is a very unusual concept...  figuring out where the lighting is leaves me somewhat befuddled.  though it will no doubt give me nightmares tonight (i''ll be avoiding the cheese) it''s certainly a good concetual piece of art - it''s slightly normalised (for want of a better term) by the fact that the shoulders indicate being shorn in a fairly standard sweater - makes it a bit less other-worldly...   very original.  8.</td>', 'this is odd, scary, bizarre and very interesting.  it is a very unusual concept...  figuring out where the lighting is leaves me somewhat befuddled.  though it will no doubt give me nightmares tonight (i''ll be avoiding the cheese) it''s certainly a good concetual piece of art - it''s slightly normalised (for want of a better term) by the fact that the shoulders indicate being shorn in a fairly standard sweater - makes it a bit less other-worldly...   very original.  8.', '2004-09-10 10:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(903144, 103730, 21554, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like the vague green background as a contrast to the orange.   I might have cropped it differently.  Not sure you need that sun up there, so far from the center of attention.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like the vague green background as a contrast to the orange.   I might have cropped it differently.  Not sure you need that sun up there, so far from the center of attention.', '2004-09-10 10:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(903146, 103537, 21554, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  The gold beading along the edge makes it.  The simple leaf shape and the bronze holder are all perfect.  A little dark along the tip, but perhaps that was unavoidable.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  The gold beading along the edge makes it.  The simple leaf shape and the bronze holder are all perfect.  A little dark along the tip, but perhaps that was unavoidable.', '2004-09-10 10:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(903148, 103453, 21554, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot.  Nice colours and composition and drama.   The Bull, however, does seem just a silhouette.</td>', 'A wonderful shot.  Nice colours and composition and drama.   The Bull, however, does seem just a silhouette.', '2004-09-10 10:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(903150, 103167, 21554, '<td valign="top">An out-of-focus background would have added to the beauty here, I think.   Too much distraction from the other foliage.</td>', 'An out-of-focus background would have added to the beauty here, I think.   Too much distraction from the other foliage.', '2004-09-10 10:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(903152, 103153, 21554, '<td valign="top">I suspect you''ve already had comments about how a thinner slice would have been more dramatic.  I really like the small, wet ''feet'' at the front.</td>', 'I suspect you''ve already had comments about how a thinner slice would have been more dramatic.  I really like the small, wet ''feet'' at the front.', '2004-09-10 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(903156, 103990, 21554, '<td valign="top">Nice emotion.  Nice compostition.  Lovely light on the hand.  A small tilt to the left might have been good, though.  I like that it tells a story.</td>', 'Nice emotion.  Nice compostition.  Lovely light on the hand.  A small tilt to the left might have been good, though.  I like that it tells a story.', '2004-09-10 10:37:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(903157, 103968, 21554, '<td valign="top">Charming.  The orange slice is worth the price of admission.</td>', 'Charming.  The orange slice is worth the price of admission.', '2004-09-10 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(903159, 103876, 21554, '<td valign="top">Nice drama.  Nice lighting.  Nice play on words.</td>', 'Nice drama.  Nice lighting.  Nice play on words.', '2004-09-10 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(903160, 103728, 21554, '<td valign="top">Nice sparkle in the eye.   Background might have been blurred a bit more or the blinds closed a bit more.   The shapes and colours outside are distracting.</td>', 'Nice sparkle in the eye.   Background might have been blurred a bit more or the blinds closed a bit more.   The shapes and colours outside are distracting.', '2004-09-10 10:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(903164, 102883, 21554, '<td valign="top">The green, out of focus background is nice.  I might have tried positioning the egg so that is the only background.   Farther back on the table perhaps.    And away from that dark window frame (?) on the right.</td>', 'The green, out of focus background is nice.  I might have tried positioning the egg so that is the only background.   Farther back on the table perhaps.    And away from that dark window frame (?) on the right.', '2004-09-10 10:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(903165, 103757, 17503, '<td valign="top">Nice, one of the few graphic and simple images in the challenge that deserve a decent score!</td>', 'Nice, one of the few graphic and simple images in the challenge that deserve a decent score!', '2004-09-10 10:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(903168, 103945, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good shot, good composition but the lighting is not really from the back.</td>', 'A good shot, good composition but the lighting is not really from the back.', '2004-09-10 10:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(903169, 102398, 24642, '<td valign="top">Fresh colors.</td>', 'Fresh colors.', '2004-09-10 10:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(903176, 102983, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  I would have liked to see more of the shadow and a wider scene.</td>', 'Good colors.  I would have liked to see more of the shadow and a wider scene.', '2004-09-10 10:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(903177, 102450, 24642, '<td valign="top">Fresh</td>', 'Fresh', '2004-09-10 10:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(903179, 103222, 21554, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the pink border line, but it does glow beautifully.</td>', 'Not sure about the pink border line, but it does glow beautifully.', '2004-09-10 10:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(903181, 103510, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good portrait but I can''t see the backlighting, there are no shadows in front.</td>', 'A good portrait but I can''t see the backlighting, there are no shadows in front.', '2004-09-10 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(903183, 102106, 21554, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to see what this is.   A little frightening now that I see.</td>', 'It took me a while to see what this is.   A little frightening now that I see.', '2004-09-10 10:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(903186, 102643, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good title and composition.  Focus is a bit to soft IMO.</td>', 'Good title and composition.  Focus is a bit to soft IMO.', '2004-09-10 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(903190, 102398, 26087, '<td valign="top">Good picture.</td>', 'Good picture.', '2004-09-10 11:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(903191, 102257, 26087, '<td valign="top">Good picture.</td>', 'Good picture.', '2004-09-10 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(903193, 103719, 21554, '<td valign="top">Nice halo effect.  I might have cropped a little closer to the shoulders though.  The face is nice off to the side, but too tight to the top, I think.</td>', 'Nice halo effect.  I might have cropped a little closer to the shoulders though.  The face is nice off to the side, but too tight to the top, I think.', '2004-09-10 11:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(903195, 102761, 21554, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure exactly what''s going on here, but the colours are lovely.</td>', 'I''m not sure exactly what''s going on here, but the colours are lovely.', '2004-09-10 11:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(903196, 103641, 21554, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.   Dramatic colours.   Interesting to look at.   It keeps the eye busy.</td>', 'Nicely done.   Dramatic colours.   Interesting to look at.   It keeps the eye busy.', '2004-09-10 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(903198, 103680, 21554, '<td valign="top">Why did you cut off the glass at the bottom?</td>', 'Why did you cut off the glass at the bottom?', '2004-09-10 11:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(903199, 103715, 21554, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed.</td>', 'Beautifully composed.', '2004-09-10 11:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(903200, 102361, 21554, '<td valign="top">The background is a little too glary, but the softness of the face is lovely.</td>', 'The background is a little too glary, but the softness of the face is lovely.', '2004-09-10 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(903202, 103407, 21554, '<td valign="top">nice colours.</td>', 'nice colours.', '2004-09-10 11:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(903206, 102177, 21554, '<td valign="top">Lovely and moody feel here.   Too bad about that person staanding in the back.</td>', 'Lovely and moody feel here.   Too bad about that person staanding in the back.', '2004-09-10 11:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(903213, 103701, 21554, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.   Should have leaned the head and shoulders a bit more into the picture though.  That green light on the hands saves it from being just a silhouette.</td>', 'Nicely done.   Should have leaned the head and shoulders a bit more into the picture though.  That green light on the hands saves it from being just a silhouette.', '2004-09-10 11:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(903215, 103918, 21554, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures.   Nice not see prfect ones.</td>', 'Interesting textures.   Nice not see prfect ones.', '2004-09-10 11:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(903226, 102989, 24065, '<td valign="top">I really liked your choice of point of view rather than focusing on one window.  I find the light shining on the edge of each window very appealing.</td>', 'I really liked your choice of point of view rather than focusing on one window.  I find the light shining on the edge of each window very appealing.', '2004-09-10 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(903229, 103537, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  I like the slight halo around the edge of the leaf.</td>', 'Very clever!  I like the slight halo around the edge of the leaf.', '2004-09-10 11:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(903230, 103626, 24715, '<td valign="top">Too grainy. Otherwise good composition, backlighting, and overall happy pic.</td>', 'Too grainy. Otherwise good composition, backlighting, and overall happy pic.', '2004-09-10 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(903231, 103577, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view and the colors.  I would have cropped it closer at the bottom and right side, but then someone just left a comment on mine that said they would have cropped it differently!  So...</td>', 'I like the point of view and the colors.  I would have cropped it closer at the bottom and right side, but then someone just left a comment on mine that said they would have cropped it differently!  So...', '2004-09-10 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
