(904569, 103082, 24065, '<td valign="top">Pleasing colors and good clarity.  I would have cropped it more at the bottom, but that''s just a personal preference.  I deducted 1 point because the body was completely silhouetted, even tho the computer screen showed enough detail for you to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Pleasing colors and good clarity.  I would have cropped it more at the bottom, but that''s just a personal preference.  I deducted 1 point because the body was completely silhouetted, even tho the computer screen showed enough detail for you to meet the challenge.', '2004-09-11 09:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(904570, 103885, 24065, '<td valign="top">I can''t make any suggestions for improvement.  You''ve met the challenge, your shot is well focused, I like the use of positive and negative space.  I tended to rate natural lighting higher in this challenge because it was harder to achieve.  But being a mother this shot is very emotive and certainly has its place among the better shots.</td>', 'I can''t make any suggestions for improvement.  You''ve met the challenge, your shot is well focused, I like the use of positive and negative space.  I tended to rate natural lighting higher in this challenge because it was harder to achieve.  But being a mother this shot is very emotive and certainly has its place among the better shots.', '2004-09-11 09:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(904574, 103725, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  I like the focus and tone.  I would have cropped the black hill out of the background, but that is just a personal preference.</td>', 'Great photo!  I like the focus and tone.  I would have cropped the black hill out of the background, but that is just a personal preference.', '2004-09-11 09:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
