(904588, 102434, 19841, '<td valign="top">That''s an amusing picture :)</td>', 'That''s an amusing picture :)', '2004-09-11 10:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(904597, 103915, 19841, '<td valign="top">The difficulty with imagery like this is that it can be TOO intense.  It''s like the difference between showing two people looking at each other passionately, and showing them actually having sex.  It''s something that is better implied than shown directly.   The same thing, but with the hand alive, the person pushing around the pills (more of them) with a fingertip, would not only be more accesible, but would also have an element of suspense.  The emotional content would still be there, but toned down enough to not shock a viewer into rejecting the image.<br/> <br/>Strong emotional content is tricky to work with, you are setting yourself an admirable challenge.</td>', 'The difficulty with imagery like this is that it can be TOO intense.  It''s like the difference between showing two people looking at each other passionately, and showing them actually having sex.  It''s something that is better implied than shown directly.   The same thing, but with the hand alive, the person pushing around the pills (more of them) with a fingertip, would not only be more accesible, but would also have an element of suspense.  The emotional content would still be there, but toned down enough to not shock a viewer into rejecting the image. Strong emotional content is tricky to work with, you are setting yourself an admirable challenge.', '2004-09-11 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
