(904628, 103610, 13248, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph. The moment captured here is priceless.  I do think the light is more directional, than backlighting.</td>', 'Lovely photograph. The moment captured here is priceless.  I do think the light is more directional, than backlighting.', '2004-09-11 11:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(904630, 102357, 13248, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.  Absolutely beautiful.  I don''t think it meets the backlight challenge though since it isn''t backlighting.  The lighting is more directional.  I believe that it is much harder to keep correct exposure when you have light that is shining in front (this subjects front..)of the subject.  Since the lighting is off to the side, it is quite easy to keep the subject properly exposed.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.  Absolutely beautiful.  I don''t think it meets the backlight challenge though since it isn''t backlighting.  The lighting is more directional.  I believe that it is much harder to keep correct exposure when you have light that is shining in front (this subjects front..)of the subject.  Since the lighting is off to the side, it is quite easy to keep the subject properly exposed.', '2004-09-11 11:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(904631, 103932, 13248, '<td valign="top">This definitely meets the challenge, but the lighting is too harsh.  Especially since it is just shining in</td>', 'This definitely meets the challenge, but the lighting is too harsh.  Especially since it is just shining in', '2004-09-11 11:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
