(905622, 102398, 24065, '<td valign="top">I tried photographing flowers in water with the light underneath.  I wish I had thought of this angle.  Ended up with an outdoor shot for the entry.  My only suggestion to improve the photo would be to crop it in such a way that the overexposed petals at the top of the photo were left off.  When I scroll up enough to "crop" them, the composition still looks good with the part of the flower that holds the petals (don''t tell anyone I''m a teacher and don''t know what that''s called!!) squarely on one of the thirds.  I''m also wondering how you got such a nice shot through glass!  Good luck.</td>', 'I tried photographing flowers in water with the light underneath.  I wish I had thought of this angle.  Ended up with an outdoor shot for the entry.  My only suggestion to improve the photo would be to crop it in such a way that the overexposed petals at the top of the photo were left off.  When I scroll up enough to "crop" them, the composition still looks good with the part of the flower that holds the petals (don''t tell anyone I''m a teacher and don''t know what that''s called!!) squarely on one of the thirds.  I''m also wondering how you got such a nice shot through glass!  Good luck.', '2004-09-12 09:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(905623, 103561, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite photos in the entry.  I like the point of view, the colors, and the clarity.  Only two suggestions.  Have you ever tried Neat Image?  I''m wondering if that would improve the quality of the bllue background.  I also am wondering if a different composition with more blue sky would have made the yellow more striking.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite photos in the entry.  I like the point of view, the colors, and the clarity.  Only two suggestions.  Have you ever tried Neat Image?  I''m wondering if that would improve the quality of the bllue background.  I also am wondering if a different composition with more blue sky would have made the yellow more striking.', '2004-09-12 09:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(905626, 103724, 13610, '<td valign="top">It''s not backlit</td>', 'It''s not backlit', '2004-09-12 09:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(905663, 103994, 23680, '<td valign="top">I really like this - the black and white is great - I''m a sucker for dog pictures :)</td>', 'I really like this - the black and white is great - I''m a sucker for dog pictures :)', '2004-09-12 11:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(905678, 103732, 26401, '<td valign="top">There are some very good entries to this contest and I was struggling about which one would get my vote. I''m giving you my 10 because your photograph grabbed me and removed me from my room where I was sitting looking at the entries and listening to music and transported me to the room where you took the picture. It caused me to wonder what kind of house it was. The different shades of liight on the curtain, the hint of colour on the window case, the weave of the curtain material.<br/> <br/>A wonderful photograph in every aspect.</td>', 'There are some very good entries to this contest and I was struggling about which one would get my vote. I''m giving you my 10 because your photograph grabbed me and removed me from my room where I was sitting looking at the entries and listening to music and transported me to the room where you took the picture. It caused me to wonder what kind of house it was. The different shades of liight on the curtain, the hint of colour on the window case, the weave of the curtain material. A wonderful photograph in every aspect.', '2004-09-12 11:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(905705, 102023, 26401, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph and I''m struggeling a bit  with what I want to say. It does speak to me but I find myself wondering what she looks like so perhaps a bit of her face would caused me to vote higher. <br/> <br/>The large area of over exposed window also made me wonder if it could have been handled differently although I find the detail in the little girls clothing well considered.<br/> <br/>The bed or piece of furniture in the forground is a bit intrusive but it does hold your eye in the picture.<br/>.<br/>Perhaps other''s comments will be more helpful. It is a great entry and I hope it does well</td>', 'I like this photograph and I''m struggeling a bit  with what I want to say. It does speak to me but I find myself wondering what she looks like so perhaps a bit of her face would caused me to vote higher.  The large area of over exposed window also made me wonder if it could have been handled differently although I find the detail in the little girls clothing well considered. The bed or piece of furniture in the forground is a bit intrusive but it does hold your eye in the picture..Perhaps other''s comments will be more helpful. It is a great entry and I hope it does well', '2004-09-12 11:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(905712, 103722, 26401, '<td valign="top">White is very difficult to get the proper exposure. Perhaps closing the lens down a stop would have given a bit more detail in the petals.</td>', 'White is very difficult to get the proper exposure. Perhaps closing the lens down a stop would have given a bit more detail in the petals.', '2004-09-12 11:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(905718, 102953, 13248, '<td valign="top">Love the lines that you captured with such an everyday, simple, subject.</td>', 'Love the lines that you captured with such an everyday, simple, subject.', '2004-09-12 11:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(905719, 103729, 26401, '<td valign="top">Good wistful mood. Perhaps a bit more depth of field to bring the cat into  better focus would have helped.</td>', 'Good wistful mood. Perhaps a bit more depth of field to bring the cat into  better focus would have helped.', '2004-09-12 11:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(905720, 103082, 26401, '<td valign="top">A green hue would have made it more Matrixie if that''s what you were after.</td>', 'A green hue would have made it more Matrixie if that''s what you were after.', '2004-09-12 11:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(905725, 102135, 13248, '<td valign="top">This is the best image that I have seen.  Not only did you freeze action, but you captured some great backlighting, and the subjects have great exposure.  10</td>', 'This is the best image that I have seen.  Not only did you freeze action, but you captured some great backlighting, and the subjects have great exposure.  10', '2004-09-12 11:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(905729, 103047, 23338, '<td valign="top">There just isn''t much image at all which shows on my screen.  No way to tell what it is and whether or not it complies with the challenge.  Sorry.</td>', 'There just isn''t much image at all which shows on my screen.  No way to tell what it is and whether or not it complies with the challenge.  Sorry.', '2004-09-12 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(905730, 103590, 26401, '<td valign="top">As a bit of a tube freak I couldn''t not vote for this one.</td>', 'As a bit of a tube freak I couldn''t not vote for this one.', '2004-09-12 11:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(905731, 102174, 10634, '<td valign="top">Cropping out the bottom left would have made this better... 6</td>', 'Cropping out the bottom left would have made this better... 6', '2004-09-12 11:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(905732, 103205, 23338, '<td valign="top">It may have backlighting, but as an artistic image it leaves me cold.  Sorry, that''s just my opinion.  There may be others that disagree.</td>', 'It may have backlighting, but as an artistic image it leaves me cold.  Sorry, that''s just my opinion.  There may be others that disagree.', '2004-09-12 11:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(905734, 103948, 13248, '<td valign="top">While I adore this image, and the moment you captured, the subjects face is just too dark....it seems to be almost a silouette.  The only thing that makes it NOT a complete silouette is the detail in the underpants.  I love the detail in the water, but I wish there was just a bit more exposed face in this image.</td>', 'While I adore this image, and the moment you captured, the subjects face is just too dark....it seems to be almost a silouette.  The only thing that makes it NOT a complete silouette is the detail in the underpants.  I love the detail in the water, but I wish there was just a bit more exposed face in this image.', '2004-09-12 11:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(905736, 103453, 10634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, but the bull is a silhouette. 5</td>', 'Beautiful sky, but the bull is a silhouette. 5', '2004-09-12 11:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(905737, 103964, 10634, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the flare was intentional, but I have to be honest, I just don''t like it. this could be a great shot without it. Even leaving the flare and cropping out the top right would make this better (top right is so bright it hurts the eyes). 5</td>', 'I''m assuming the flare was intentional, but I have to be honest, I just don''t like it. this could be a great shot without it. Even leaving the flare and cropping out the top right would make this better (top right is so bright it hurts the eyes). 5', '2004-09-12 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(905741, 102726, 4380, '<td valign="top">whew! after browsing the entries i finally found the image the conformed with the theme, most of the entries are not backlighted. the concept is a little cliche, but its still great for me, the lighting is really great, and i like for using the different colours....i hope this make it to the circle of three,good luck for your finework...congrats.  10!!!!</td>', 'whew! after browsing the entries i finally found the image the conformed with the theme, most of the entries are not backlighted. the concept is a little cliche, but its still great for me, the lighting is really great, and i like for using the different colours....i hope this make it to the circle of three,good luck for your finework...congrats.  10!!!!', '2004-09-12 11:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(905745, 103047, 10634, '<td valign="top">Just gotta ask, what is this? 5</td>', 'Just gotta ask, what is this? 5', '2004-09-12 11:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(905748, 103970, 4380, '<td valign="top">i like the simplicity of your image, works perfectly, the colours are superb. congrats to your image!!! 10!</td>', 'i like the simplicity of your image, works perfectly, the colours are superb. congrats to your image!!! 10!', '2004-09-12 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905751, 103985, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea... 7</td>', 'Very unique idea... 7', '2004-09-12 11:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(905754, 103918, 10634, '<td valign="top">While I''m sure this is backlit, the frontal lighting overwhelms it. The focus on the red pepepr is also a little soft... 5</td>', 'While I''m sure this is backlit, the frontal lighting overwhelms it. The focus on the red pepepr is also a little soft... 5', '2004-09-12 11:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(905757, 103282, 23338, '<td valign="top">Backlighting, sidelighting - they exist, but as for pose, detail and general appeal as an artistic image, it just doesn''t rate very high on my personal preference scale.   The pose is more of a lackadaisical position and requires something to add tension, form and beauty.  There is a conflict, too, between the really bright area along the side of the arm and the total lack of detail in the upper chest and head area.    Others may disagree, and probably do.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Backlighting, sidelighting - they exist, but as for pose, detail and general appeal as an artistic image, it just doesn''t rate very high on my personal preference scale.   The pose is more of a lackadaisical position and requires something to add tension, form and beauty.  There is a conflict, too, between the really bright area along the side of the arm and the total lack of detail in the upper chest and head area.    Others may disagree, and probably do.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-12 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(905765, 103094, 23338, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s the muddy colors, possibly the uncomfortable feeling one gets looking at the sun in the water, but I am not drawn to this image.  It IS good that it catches the ripples and that there appears to be some depth to the water, but it needs something more to make it attractive - maybe brighter green tones, possibly more detail in the reflected leaves, even less specular highllights.  Because of the reflection rather than light from behind, it''s also questionable whether it meets the critera of "backlighting".    Good luck with other raters, though.</td>', 'Maybe it''s the muddy colors, possibly the uncomfortable feeling one gets looking at the sun in the water, but I am not drawn to this image.  It IS good that it catches the ripples and that there appears to be some depth to the water, but it needs something more to make it attractive - maybe brighter green tones, possibly more detail in the reflected leaves, even less specular highllights.  Because of the reflection rather than light from behind, it''s also questionable whether it meets the critera of "backlighting".    Good luck with other raters, though.', '2004-09-12 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(905768, 103530, 23338, '<td valign="top">Lost almost all of the detail - makes it very silhouettish (if that''s a word and spelled correctly).   Possibly needs fill flash?   Others may disagree.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Lost almost all of the detail - makes it very silhouettish (if that''s a word and spelled correctly).   Possibly needs fill flash?   Others may disagree.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 12:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(905771, 102886, 23338, '<td valign="top">Neat image, but it really lost the detail - at least from what I can see.  Maybe with less "brights" and a little subject and foreground dodging it would appeal more.  Just my opinion.  Others may disagree.  Good luck.</td>', 'Neat image, but it really lost the detail - at least from what I can see.  Maybe with less "brights" and a little subject and foreground dodging it would appeal more.  Just my opinion.  Others may disagree.  Good luck.', '2004-09-12 12:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(905781, 103108, 23338, '<td valign="top">I think my major problem with this image is that it''s so busy.  The bright colors in the background are distracting.  It also is hard to tell if we''re getting side light reflections or any real "backlighting".   I assume the cropping is because it allows you to concentrate on the sculpture and not on its base.  I would have loved to see the tip of the top fin against the plain background.  That would have helped some.  Anyway, the glass itself has nice reflections and is focused properly along the side of the body and the front of the fin.  A little more DOF might have brought out the tail, too.  Maybe a black backdrop would help?  Those are my thoughts - others may disagree.   Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I think my major problem with this image is that it''s so busy.  The bright colors in the background are distracting.  It also is hard to tell if we''re getting side light reflections or any real "backlighting".   I assume the cropping is because it allows you to concentrate on the sculpture and not on its base.  I would have loved to see the tip of the top fin against the plain background.  That would have helped some.  Anyway, the glass itself has nice reflections and is focused properly along the side of the body and the front of the fin.  A little more DOF might have brought out the tail, too.  Maybe a black backdrop would help?  Those are my thoughts - others may disagree.   Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 12:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905787, 103971, 23338, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...  I really don''t know where to go with this one.  I can see a certain abstract quality, even modernistic bent to the image.  But, there''s something lacking in general appeal to me.   It''s not composition or balance, that seems to be there.  There is backlighting.  Maybe its because I try so hard to focus all the time with my bifocals.   Sorry.   Good luck with the other raters.</td>', 'Hmmm...  I really don''t know where to go with this one.  I can see a certain abstract quality, even modernistic bent to the image.  But, there''s something lacking in general appeal to me.   It''s not composition or balance, that seems to be there.  There is backlighting.  Maybe its because I try so hard to focus all the time with my bifocals.   Sorry.   Good luck with the other raters.', '2004-09-12 12:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(905792, 102106, 23338, '<td valign="top">You know, this is sick.  Never-the-less, there is a gallery somewhere that would love it.  Just not me.  I''d rate it lower, but it has definite backlighting, detail and contrast.  Where''s the printing that says, "Danger: Do not place over your head!" ?</td>', 'You know, this is sick.  Never-the-less, there is a gallery somewhere that would love it.  Just not me.  I''d rate it lower, but it has definite backlighting, detail and contrast.  Where''s the printing that says, "Danger: Do not place over your head!" ?', '2004-09-12 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(905816, 103907, 19953, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time SEEING the web.  It''s mostly dark...</td>', 'I have a hard time SEEING the web.  It''s mostly dark...', '2004-09-12 13:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(905818, 103453, 19953, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have realized the animal was in the picture if not for the title...</td>', 'I wouldn''t have realized the animal was in the picture if not for the title...', '2004-09-12 13:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(905850, 103547, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent image</td>', 'Excellent image', '2004-09-12 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
