(906033, 102759, 14671, '<td valign="top">night shooting is very difficult to achieve.  The magenta (yellow/amber) light plays a lot of tricks with cameras. Perhaps a darker setting ould have made it stand out more and gotten rid of the hotspots on the bench.</td>', 'night shooting is very difficult to achieve.  The magenta (yellow/amber) light plays a lot of tricks with cameras. Perhaps a darker setting ould have made it stand out more and gotten rid of the hotspots on the bench.', '2004-09-12 17:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
