(906161, 103578, 25996, '<td valign="top">backlighting?</td>', 'backlighting?', '2004-09-12 19:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(906171, 103922, 23338, '<td valign="top">You know, this is one of those photos that is so subtle that I passed it right by the first few times I was rating ... and then I viewed it while in just the right mood and, Bingo!  It clicked.  Its just so darn delicate and monotone that you have to look closely and then concentrate on patterns, subtle contrasts, shadows, focusing details, light gently seeping through ...  I ended up adding multiple points to my first rating.  Nice image.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'You know, this is one of those photos that is so subtle that I passed it right by the first few times I was rating ... and then I viewed it while in just the right mood and, Bingo!  It clicked.  Its just so darn delicate and monotone that you have to look closely and then concentrate on patterns, subtle contrasts, shadows, focusing details, light gently seeping through ...  I ended up adding multiple points to my first rating.  Nice image.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-09-12 19:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(906172, 103508, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of image you expect to see people pick up for high class interior decorating.  It really is a striking combination of colors, highlights and contrasts.   The composition is such that everything (circular color scheme, grouping of plant stems, bright lights) draws you into the center focal point where all light eminates.  Really nice image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This is the kind of image you expect to see people pick up for high class interior decorating.  It really is a striking combination of colors, highlights and contrasts.   The composition is such that everything (circular color scheme, grouping of plant stems, bright lights) draws you into the center focal point where all light eminates.  Really nice image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 19:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(906181, 103750, 23338, '<td valign="top">I just love critiquing photographs.  This image is an extraordinary example of why.  You could sit here for hours and just get lost in the exquisite detail of those petals, in the blending of colors from bright yellows to bright orange/reds to dark orange/reds to yellows to dark yellows to yellow/greens to dark greens - all creating contrasts in a radiating pattern going outward from dark to light ...  Of course, you know that.  You took the image.  Cool cropping, too.  Congratulations.  It''s great!</td>', 'I just love critiquing photographs.  This image is an extraordinary example of why.  You could sit here for hours and just get lost in the exquisite detail of those petals, in the blending of colors from bright yellows to bright orange/reds to dark orange/reds to yellows to dark yellows to yellow/greens to dark greens - all creating contrasts in a radiating pattern going outward from dark to light ...  Of course, you know that.  You took the image.  Cool cropping, too.  Congratulations.  It''s great!', '2004-09-12 19:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(906191, 102023, 23338, '<td valign="top">From my viewpoint, this image has lots of higher potential, depending upon how it is printed.  Right now it appears to me to have too much bright highlight in the door window.  You can''t see any detail in the actual curtain except in a couple of places around the edge and at the bottom.  If the curtain detail or pattern showed more, and the most extreme bright was toned down to the area where the young girl is peeking around the curtain it might tend to draw the eye more to the main action in the image and cause you to squint less.  In other words, less is more.  (If only I could do that with my commenting... ) At least that''s my opinion.  You may have already tried that and discarded it as a possiblity.  It IS a nice image.</td>', 'From my viewpoint, this image has lots of higher potential, depending upon how it is printed.  Right now it appears to me to have too much bright highlight in the door window.  You can''t see any detail in the actual curtain except in a couple of places around the edge and at the bottom.  If the curtain detail or pattern showed more, and the most extreme bright was toned down to the area where the young girl is peeking around the curtain it might tend to draw the eye more to the main action in the image and cause you to squint less.  In other words, less is more.  (If only I could do that with my commenting... ) At least that''s my opinion.  You may have already tried that and discarded it as a possiblity.  It IS a nice image.', '2004-09-12 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(906200, 103910, 23338, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast and the detail on the cat tail.  Nice focus.  Only recommendation would have been to slip a black backdrop behind the near leaves and stems and eliminate the out of focus ones in back entirely.  They tend to distract me when viewing the overall image.</td>', 'I really like the contrast and the detail on the cat tail.  Nice focus.  Only recommendation would have been to slip a black backdrop behind the near leaves and stems and eliminate the out of focus ones in back entirely.  They tend to distract me when viewing the overall image.', '2004-09-12 19:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(906204, 103568, 23338, '<td valign="top">Same set, different subject (an artichoke, bell pepper, tomato or apple), and I would have been attracted to the image a lot more.  The image may also have been more concise with cropping which allowed more of the right and left edges of the circle to show, thus allowing the dark background to form more of the entire circle.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Same set, different subject (an artichoke, bell pepper, tomato or apple), and I would have been attracted to the image a lot more.  The image may also have been more concise with cropping which allowed more of the right and left edges of the circle to show, thus allowing the dark background to form more of the entire circle.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 20:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(906210, 102327, 26518, '<td valign="top">Details are a bit fuzzy.  The ceiling shadows are nice.</td>', 'Details are a bit fuzzy.  The ceiling shadows are nice.', '2004-09-12 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(906211, 102890, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''d be looking for more focus and detail in this image.  It looks slightly cloudy.  Nice idea though.  Don''t change the dark background.  That works, except where the object it''s resting on shows.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I''d be looking for more focus and detail in this image.  It looks slightly cloudy.  Nice idea though.  Don''t change the dark background.  That works, except where the object it''s resting on shows.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(906212, 102556, 26518, '<td valign="top">The top of the statue is too dark.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'The top of the statue is too dark.  Interesting shot.', '2004-09-12 20:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(906213, 103382, 26518, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color!  Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting use of color!  Nice work.', '2004-09-12 20:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(906214, 103387, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is an example of what many folks in this challenge failed to achieve - subject and surrounding having plenty of detail, even subdued colors in many areas, without blowing everything out with atomic highlights.  I like the extreme detail and the sharp contrasts.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This is an example of what many folks in this challenge failed to achieve - subject and surrounding having plenty of detail, even subdued colors in many areas, without blowing everything out with atomic highlights.  I like the extreme detail and the sharp contrasts.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(906215, 103988, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really nice image.  It''s cool how you were able to stop some action and yet retain vibrant colors, great detail and good focus.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Really nice image.  It''s cool how you were able to stop some action and yet retain vibrant colors, great detail and good focus.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(906216, 102724, 26518, '<td valign="top">Good selection of background for this leaf.  Makes for a nice monochrome effect.</td>', 'Good selection of background for this leaf.  Makes for a nice monochrome effect.', '2004-09-12 20:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(906222, 103749, 23338, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Not just because I like limes, either.  It has a very balanced overall impact, good contrasts, great detail and, obviously, a strong application of the theme of the challenge, "Backlighting".  As a result, it is a very strong image with lasting impact.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I really like this image.  Not just because I like limes, either.  It has a very balanced overall impact, good contrasts, great detail and, obviously, a strong application of the theme of the challenge, "Backlighting".  As a result, it is a very strong image with lasting impact.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(906223, 103968, 23338, '<td valign="top">You could play all day with various combinations of the composition of this image - but, bottom line: It''s very attractive.  It''s the kind of image you would expect to see in lots of different commenrcial settings with a back lit frame to show it off.  The contrasts between darks and lights, hard and soft, sweet, bitter and no taste - they''re all there.  Congratulations.</td>', 'You could play all day with various combinations of the composition of this image - but, bottom line: It''s very attractive.  It''s the kind of image you would expect to see in lots of different commenrcial settings with a back lit frame to show it off.  The contrasts between darks and lights, hard and soft, sweet, bitter and no taste - they''re all there.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(906224, 103069, 23338, '<td valign="top">The first time I went through these 369 images, I knew this one would be in one of my top ten - just not sure where.  The composition and the contrasts are really great.  Very eye catching.  Probably the only problem I have when viewing it is that after a while there appears to be a "double exposure" effect to the left between the bottom flower and the front center one.  I know there isn''t, but my eyes stumble over that portion of the image.  As a result it has a little bit a a disquieting effect and I ended up rating it not quite as high as I would have.  But, it''s a very nice image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'The first time I went through these 369 images, I knew this one would be in one of my top ten - just not sure where.  The composition and the contrasts are really great.  Very eye catching.  Probably the only problem I have when viewing it is that after a while there appears to be a "double exposure" effect to the left between the bottom flower and the front center one.  I know there isn''t, but my eyes stumble over that portion of the image.  As a result it has a little bit a a disquieting effect and I ended up rating it not quite as high as I would have.  But, it''s a very nice image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(906225, 103702, 23338, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite image from the entire challenge.   The detail, the focus, the color scheme, the backlighting, the almost transparent appearance of the body, the wetness ...  its all there.  I also love the composition, with the snail practically suspended above the clean, dark void with only a hint of support.   Just added this image to my favorites.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This was my favorite image from the entire challenge.   The detail, the focus, the color scheme, the backlighting, the almost transparent appearance of the body, the wetness ...  its all there.  I also love the composition, with the snail practically suspended above the clean, dark void with only a hint of support.   Just added this image to my favorites.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(906226, 103426, 23338, '<td valign="top">Love the color, the texture, the reflected light, the overall tones and shadows, the detail and focus, the contrast, the composition - what else can you say?  It''s a 10 in my book.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Love the color, the texture, the reflected light, the overall tones and shadows, the detail and focus, the contrast, the composition - what else can you say?  It''s a 10 in my book.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(906230, 103904, 23338, '<td valign="top">Very strange and interesting.  My eyes have trouble creating fact over fiction - how do the yellow/orange slices connect to the blue portion of the image?  The contrast, composition and detail are really nice.   Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Very strange and interesting.  My eyes have trouble creating fact over fiction - how do the yellow/orange slices connect to the blue portion of the image?  The contrast, composition and detail are really nice.   Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 20:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(906232, 103641, 23338, '<td valign="top">1,000% for composition, detail and contrasts.  Really nice image.  Must have taken a good bit of effort to set up the perspective so perfectly.  Congratulations.</td>', '1,000% for composition, detail and contrasts.  Really nice image.  Must have taken a good bit of effort to set up the perspective so perfectly.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(906234, 103597, 23338, '<td valign="top">I will guarantee that with MY Sony DSC T1 I could never capture this moment.  Not in 1,000 shots.  Nice timing, cool (no pun intended) colors and perspective.  I like!  Congratulations.</td>', 'I will guarantee that with MY Sony DSC T1 I could never capture this moment.  Not in 1,000 shots.  Nice timing, cool (no pun intended) colors and perspective.  I like!  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(906235, 102901, 6532, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks - I like the tones and composition</td>', 'One of my top picks - I like the tones and composition', '2004-09-12 20:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(906237, 103508, 6532, '<td valign="top">One os my top picks - good job!</td>', 'One os my top picks - good job!', '2004-09-12 20:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(906238, 103458, 6532, '<td valign="top">Definitely a winner - very nice, great color and compostion.</td>', 'Definitely a winner - very nice, great color and compostion.', '2004-09-12 20:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(906242, 102803, 6532, '<td valign="top">I guess it is the expression on the older boys face that speaks and adds interest to this capture.... nice composition as well. A bit blurry overall except the rocks in the foreground.  nice try. 8</td>', 'I guess it is the expression on the older boys face that speaks and adds interest to this capture.... nice composition as well. A bit blurry overall except the rocks in the foreground.  nice try. 8', '2004-09-12 20:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(906245, 102442, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrasting/complementing colors.</td>', 'Nice use of contrasting/complementing colors.', '2004-09-12 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(906246, 103047, 6532, '<td valign="top">I can not tell what this is and i surely do not see the light...</td>', 'I can not tell what this is and i surely do not see the light...', '2004-09-12 20:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(906247, 103715, 23338, '<td valign="top">You know, there are some flowers that you couldn''t mess up no matter how you tried to take thier photo.  This strikes me as one of them.  :-)  You have a very interesting flower shape, well composed, nicely backlit, with great contrasts.  It works alot, and I like it.  Congratulations.</td>', 'You know, there are some flowers that you couldn''t mess up no matter how you tried to take thier photo.  This strikes me as one of them.  :-)  You have a very interesting flower shape, well composed, nicely backlit, with great contrasts.  It works alot, and I like it.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 20:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(906248, 102328, 6532, '<td valign="top">This does not appear to be backlit but lit more from an overhead source of light....and some what out of focus as well...</td>', 'This does not appear to be backlit but lit more from an overhead source of light....and some what out of focus as well...', '2004-09-12 20:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(906249, 102886, 6532, '<td valign="top">the subject must not become a silhouette because of the backlighting...</td>', 'the subject must not become a silhouette because of the backlighting...', '2004-09-12 20:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(906250, 102174, 6532, '<td valign="top">The subject is a bit too dark for me.  Borders on being a silhouette because of the backlighting...</td>', 'The subject is a bit too dark for me.  Borders on being a silhouette because of the backlighting...', '2004-09-12 21:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(906251, 103082, 23338, '<td valign="top">You''ve been watching a little "Matrix", I see.  Nice image.  I would have rated higher, but had problems in terms of the challenge definition with all the silhouettes.  But, I liked it.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'You''ve been watching a little "Matrix", I see.  Nice image.  I would have rated higher, but had problems in terms of the challenge definition with all the silhouettes.  But, I liked it.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 21:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(906252, 103701, 6532, '<td valign="top">the subject must not become a silhouette because of the backlighting...</td>', 'the subject must not become a silhouette because of the backlighting...', '2004-09-12 21:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(906254, 102686, 6532, '<td valign="top">The light is causing too much distraction/glare.<br/>...</td>', 'The light is causing too much distraction/glare....', '2004-09-12 21:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(906255, 102556, 6532, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark - the subject borders on becoming a silhouette because of the backlighting...</td>', 'a bit too dark - the subject borders on becoming a silhouette because of the backlighting...', '2004-09-12 21:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(906257, 103985, 23338, '<td valign="top">How many times as I was growing up did I play with flashlights to creat this same image ...  ?  I''m not sure why, but maybe because it was not new to me, I rated the image lower initially.  Then, as I went through the challenge rating the images time and again, I ended up raising your rating at various times.  It IS a really nice image.  My fingers always ended up more "yellow" looking though because of the flashlight.  :-)  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'How many times as I was growing up did I play with flashlights to creat this same image ...  ?  I''m not sure why, but maybe because it was not new to me, I rated the image lower initially.  Then, as I went through the challenge rating the images time and again, I ended up raising your rating at various times.  It IS a really nice image.  My fingers always ended up more "yellow" looking though because of the flashlight.  :-)  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 21:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(906263, 103602, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great stuff!</td>', 'Great stuff!', '2004-09-12 21:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(906265, 102278, 16301, '<td valign="top">Really cool photo, it definitely stands out. (9) Good luck...</td>', 'Really cool photo, it definitely stands out. (9) Good luck...', '2004-09-12 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(906266, 102135, 23338, '<td valign="top">Yes, and you can see it on their faces.  Wonderful stop action image. Too bad the child in the front has his hand over the face of the boy in the back on the right.  And I would have rated slightly higher if there was slightly more detail on the faces and the fronts of the bodies.  I would have cropped a little more, too.  Centered the image, got rid of the bottom 1/5th and the left and right 1/8th or so.  But, hey!  That''s just me.  You have a really nice image.</td>', 'Yes, and you can see it on their faces.  Wonderful stop action image. Too bad the child in the front has his hand over the face of the boy in the back on the right.  And I would have rated slightly higher if there was slightly more detail on the faces and the fronts of the bodies.  I would have cropped a little more, too.  Centered the image, got rid of the bottom 1/5th and the left and right 1/8th or so.  But, hey!  That''s just me.  You have a really nice image.', '2004-09-12 21:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(906267, 102357, 23338, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and composition.  Wonderful setting and pose.  I only had two problems in viewing: 1) the table base had such clarity and reflectiveness that it tended to overpower the image of the body; and, 2) given the lighting on the subject, the shadows appeared very indistinct and far toward the background than what I would have expected.   As a result, I ended up puzzling over the "whys" rather than enjoying the image as much as I would have expected.  But, again, a VERY nice image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and composition.  Wonderful setting and pose.  I only had two problems in viewing: 1) the table base had such clarity and reflectiveness that it tended to overpower the image of the body; and, 2) given the lighting on the subject, the shadows appeared very indistinct and far toward the background than what I would have expected.   As a result, I ended up puzzling over the "whys" rather than enjoying the image as much as I would have expected.  But, again, a VERY nice image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 21:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(906268, 102357, 1368, '<td valign="top">:O WooooooW  *eyes drop out*<br/>If this picture does not get a blue ribbon I will quit this site!</td>', ':O WooooooW  *eyes drop out*If this picture does not get a blue ribbon I will quit this site!', '2004-09-12 21:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(906271, 103722, 23338, '<td valign="top">Everything was so clear and distinct, and in focus, and full of contrast.  Well composed.  But, what the heck was that little dark fleck of dirt on the bottom petal to the left?  Drove me crazy.   Nice image though.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Everything was so clear and distinct, and in focus, and full of contrast.  Well composed.  But, what the heck was that little dark fleck of dirt on the bottom petal to the left?  Drove me crazy.   Nice image though.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(906273, 103761, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed.  I would have put some kind of light spot on the label though, to make it more readable.  But, hey!  That''s just me.  Congratulations on a nice image and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely posed.  I would have put some kind of light spot on the label though, to make it more readable.  But, hey!  That''s just me.  Congratulations on a nice image and good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 21:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(906275, 103673, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really nice image.  Because of the backlighting of the bright green leaves, the subdued and slightly out of focus background in this image doesn''t conflict with the foreground image, it actually complements it.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Really nice image.  Because of the backlighting of the bright green leaves, the subdued and slightly out of focus background in this image doesn''t conflict with the foreground image, it actually complements it.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-12 21:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(906279, 102271, 23338, '<td valign="top">Printed onto a plastic substrate, framed and mounted with backlighting, this would be great in some yachting bar or coastal city restaurant.  Very nice image.</td>', 'Printed onto a plastic substrate, framed and mounted with backlighting, this would be great in some yachting bar or coastal city restaurant.  Very nice image.', '2004-09-12 21:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(906284, 102807, 23338, '<td valign="top">I really liked this image.  The bright bar coming in from the right at the center of the image really bothered me though.  I would burn it out in future versions if it were my image.  Anyway, that''s my opinion.  With the exception of that, it''s a really great image.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I really liked this image.  The bright bar coming in from the right at the center of the image really bothered me though.  I would burn it out in future versions if it were my image.  Anyway, that''s my opinion.  With the exception of that, it''s a really great image.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-12 21:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(906289, 102872, 23338, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... did we see this guy in the "Framing" challenge?  :-)  Nice "backlighting".  Really cool detail and focus.   I''m beginning to like, Emus? is it?  Anyway, nice image.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm... did we see this guy in the "Framing" challenge?  :-)  Nice "backlighting".  Really cool detail and focus.   I''m beginning to like, Emus? is it?  Anyway, nice image.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-12 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(906295, 103885, 24079, '<td valign="top">The bit of grey on the right is a little distracting, but other than that it''s a wonderful shot and good idea!</td>', 'The bit of grey on the right is a little distracting, but other than that it''s a wonderful shot and good idea!', '2004-09-12 21:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(906373, 103453, 25989, '<td valign="top">Bul (subjet) is in silhouette, so it doesn''t meet the challenge.  Otherwise, nice photo, love the sunset and clouds.</td>', 'Bul (subjet) is in silhouette, so it doesn''t meet the challenge.  Otherwise, nice photo, love the sunset and clouds.', '2004-09-12 22:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
