(906471, 102272, 13381, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, but way too grainy. (I bet you''re getting that comment a lot.  Focus on the lovely composition part.)</td>', 'Lovely composition, but way too grainy. (I bet you''re getting that comment a lot.  Focus on the lovely composition part.)', '2004-09-12 23:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
