(907078, 103453, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! I think this bull may have strayed away from the contest rule, can''t be in silhouette.</td>', 'Nice photo! I think this bull may have strayed away from the contest rule, can''t be in silhouette.', '2004-09-13 04:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(907081, 103378, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Great use of white on white, and shooting this using backlighting.  I would have liked to see some light reflected in the dogs eyes, some sparkle in them. Tilt his head at another angle? (Lots on luck here.) Maybe the lighting a little more from headhead? Cute dog, good job!</td>', 'Nice photo. Great use of white on white, and shooting this using backlighting.  I would have liked to see some light reflected in the dogs eyes, some sparkle in them. Tilt his head at another angle? (Lots on luck here.) Maybe the lighting a little more from headhead? Cute dog, good job!', '2004-09-13 04:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(907093, 103475, 16266, '<td valign="top">i would have framed this a little diferent, not hugged the left side so close,  otherwise, great shot.</td>', 'i would have framed this a little diferent, not hugged the left side so close,  otherwise, great shot.', '2004-09-13 04:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
