(907234, 103049, 25486, '<td valign="top">A nice idea but I''m afraid I''ve seen better examples, the backlighting effect doesn''t really come through somehow.</td>', 'A nice idea but I''m afraid I''ve seen better examples, the backlighting effect doesn''t really come through somehow.', '2004-09-13 07:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(907236, 103986, 25486, '<td valign="top">Quite4 a nice idea, at least it shows that you have thought about the title of the challange and come up with something original.</td>', 'Quite4 a nice idea, at least it shows that you have thought about the title of the challange and come up with something original.', '2004-09-13 07:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
