(907241, 103983, 25486, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t find this image appealing at all, that''s just my personal opinion.  It reminds me of the type of stock shots you see for advertising.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t find this image appealing at all, that''s just my personal opinion.  It reminds me of the type of stock shots you see for advertising.', '2004-09-13 07:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
