(907247, 103756, 25486, '<td valign="top">This is the shot I wish I''d taken.  The light is wonderful, which is what makes most good photographs.  Its well balanced and not too burnt out in the sky, well framed by the overhanging branches etc.  It meets the challange criteria.  Not sure how it could be improved really.  Very well done.</td>', 'This is the shot I wish I''d taken.  The light is wonderful, which is what makes most good photographs.  Its well balanced and not too burnt out in the sky, well framed by the overhanging branches etc.  It meets the challange criteria.  Not sure how it could be improved really.  Very well done.', '2004-09-13 07:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(907248, 103540, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, light and frame.  Nice detail.  Just a bit too abstract for me to put into any context really.</td>', 'Nice colours, light and frame.  Nice detail.  Just a bit too abstract for me to put into any context really.', '2004-09-13 07:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
