(907352, 103976, 25486, '<td valign="top">Pleasant still life shot, nice colours and contrasting textures.  Can''t help thinking that the real thing works much better than the photograph so why take the image??  Just the way my mind works, sorry.</td>', 'Pleasant still life shot, nice colours and contrasting textures.  Can''t help thinking that the real thing works much better than the photograph so why take the image??  Just the way my mind works, sorry.', '2004-09-13 09:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
