(907357, 102346, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely worked classical image.  One of the better of the backlit flower shots.  Not original though but as the image stands a good example.</td>', 'Nicely worked classical image.  One of the better of the backlit flower shots.  Not original though but as the image stands a good example.', '2004-09-13 09:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(907362, 103564, 25486, '<td valign="top">I feel that the image could have been improved a lot by changing the viewpoint.  The rocks in the background detract from the impact of the main subject.  The mono effect makes in look a bit flat.  What I''m trying to say is the main subject doesn''t stand out from the background enough.</td>', 'I feel that the image could have been improved a lot by changing the viewpoint.  The rocks in the background detract from the impact of the main subject.  The mono effect makes in look a bit flat.  What I''m trying to say is the main subject doesn''t stand out from the background enough.', '2004-09-13 09:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
