(907366, 103915, 25486, '<td valign="top">A different way of looking at the use of photography to that which I''m used to but as an image its good.  I would have just gone with the image of the hand myself, it could be quite strong on its own.</td>', 'A different way of looking at the use of photography to that which I''m used to but as an image its good.  I would have just gone with the image of the hand myself, it could be quite strong on its own.', '2004-09-13 09:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
