(908846, 103913, 21158, '<td valign="top">I like the tone you set in this shot  7</td>', 'I like the tone you set in this shot  7', '2004-09-14 05:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(908847, 103222, 21158, '<td valign="top">the dual border really enhanced this pic</td>', 'the dual border really enhanced this pic', '2004-09-14 05:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(908865, 103901, 3280, '<td valign="top">Centered a bit too much but good idea and follow through.</td>', 'Centered a bit too much but good idea and follow through.', '2004-09-14 05:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(908875, 103964, 25486, '<td valign="top">Its certainly backlit, but too much in my opinion.  Needs less exsposure.  Always a tricky one backlighting because the camera''s auto exsposure will not be able to cope.  Try shooting a series of shots with a range of settings then pick the best one.  Unless you intended it to be this way of course?</td>', 'Its certainly backlit, but too much in my opinion.  Needs less exsposure.  Always a tricky one backlighting because the camera''s auto exsposure will not be able to cope.  Try shooting a series of shots with a range of settings then pick the best one.  Unless you intended it to be this way of course?', '2004-09-14 06:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(908876, 102398, 25486, '<td valign="top">Unusual, entertaining and brightly coloured shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Unusual, entertaining and brightly coloured shot.  Well done.', '2004-09-14 06:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(908877, 103692, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely picked out detail. Focus is pot on and the colours are great.</td>', 'Nicely picked out detail. Focus is pot on and the colours are great.', '2004-09-14 06:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(908883, 103994, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  What a fabulous scene.  The greyscale gives it extra apeal in my view.  The composition culd have been a little better I think.  The postion of the sailboat directly above the parasol?  Might have been better to one side.  One other thing is that the horizon is not quite level, it slopes slightly down to the right.  With this type of shot it must be absolutely level.  But well done for capturing it.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  What a fabulous scene.  The greyscale gives it extra apeal in my view.  The composition culd have been a little better I think.  The postion of the sailboat directly above the parasol?  Might have been better to one side.  One other thing is that the horizon is not quite level, it slopes slightly down to the right.  With this type of shot it must be absolutely level.  But well done for capturing it.', '2004-09-14 06:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(908886, 102023, 25486, '<td valign="top">A simply beautiful shot.  I think the corner of the bed should have been left out by moving slightly to the left.  Perhaps cropping a little tighter.  The lighting is superb, well done.</td>', 'A simply beautiful shot.  I think the corner of the bed should have been left out by moving slightly to the left.  Perhaps cropping a little tighter.  The lighting is superb, well done.', '2004-09-14 06:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(908887, 102408, 25486, '<td valign="top">An interesting portrait, well executed.</td>', 'An interesting portrait, well executed.', '2004-09-14 06:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(908889, 103971, 25486, '<td valign="top">I thing I see what you''re getting at but I''m not sure it works.  The shot is a bit too dark to give the feeling of sunlight and I do think it needs at least one point of focus.</td>', 'I thing I see what you''re getting at but I''m not sure it works.  The shot is a bit too dark to give the feeling of sunlight and I do think it needs at least one point of focus.', '2004-09-14 06:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(908891, 103057, 25486, '<td valign="top">I know what you mean but I don''t think you''ve quite caught it here.  Firstly I would try moving further back or to the right to narrow the gap at the end, not close it altogether though.  Next take a few shots with different exsposure settings.  The trees are a bit too dark because the camera has tried to exspose for the bright area between the trees.  You could also try a lower view point by getting down on one knee?  Just my humble suggestions.</td>', 'I know what you mean but I don''t think you''ve quite caught it here.  Firstly I would try moving further back or to the right to narrow the gap at the end, not close it altogether though.  Next take a few shots with different exsposure settings.  The trees are a bit too dark because the camera has tried to exspose for the bright area between the trees.  You could also try a lower view point by getting down on one knee?  Just my humble suggestions.', '2004-09-14 06:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(908893, 103047, 25486, '<td valign="top">Sorry don''t understand this one, please explain?</td>', 'Sorry don''t understand this one, please explain?', '2004-09-14 06:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(908894, 103922, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, refreshingly different.</td>', 'Nice idea, refreshingly different.', '2004-09-14 06:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(908898, 102759, 25486, '<td valign="top">I always like the shot that tries to be different from the obvious and this is one of those.  Unfortunately, because of the low light and long exsposure required, it isn''t sharp enough.  There doesn''t seem to be any of part which is pin sharp, the cup is just off I think?  I still like the shot but it would have got a higher mark but for that.</td>', 'I always like the shot that tries to be different from the obvious and this is one of those.  Unfortunately, because of the low light and long exsposure required, it isn''t sharp enough.  There doesn''t seem to be any of part which is pin sharp, the cup is just off I think?  I still like the shot but it would have got a higher mark but for that.', '2004-09-14 06:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(908902, 103743, 25486, '<td valign="top">The colours are wonderful and the silhouetted trees are great, but the shot seems to be leaning to the left, the trees are not vertical.  Also the telegraph pole in my opinion detracts from the shot.  Try moving position to eliminate unwanted detail from the shot.</td>', 'The colours are wonderful and the silhouetted trees are great, but the shot seems to be leaning to the left, the trees are not vertical.  Also the telegraph pole in my opinion detracts from the shot.  Try moving position to eliminate unwanted detail from the shot.', '2004-09-14 06:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(908910, 103667, 21084, '<td valign="top">mmmmmmm yummmmy<br/>good photo of my favorite drink -</td>', 'mmmmmmm yummmmygood photo of my favorite drink -', '2004-09-14 06:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(908912, 103384, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The photographer has done well to get as much in to the shot without making it too distant.  The light and the shadows are very pleasing.  But somehow not quite dramatic enough.  The shot also seems to lack somewhere for the eye to go to.  If the path was leading you into the shot it would have been better.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The photographer has done well to get as much in to the shot without making it too distant.  The light and the shadows are very pleasing.  But somehow not quite dramatic enough.  The shot also seems to lack somewhere for the eye to go to.  If the path was leading you into the shot it would have been better.', '2004-09-14 07:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(908913, 103000, 25486, '<td valign="top">A pleasing shot, I''d be very tempted to shoot it myself and the greyscale is the correct medium I think.  But the shot laks a point of interest for the eye to rest on, following the line of trees.</td>', 'A pleasing shot, I''d be very tempted to shoot it myself and the greyscale is the correct medium I think.  But the shot laks a point of interest for the eye to rest on, following the line of trees.', '2004-09-14 07:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
