(909090, 103703, 9821, '<td valign="top">I''m going to guess that this shot won''t be in the top 20, but it definately should. At DPC, you''re taking a risk every time you submit a photo shat isn''t tack sharp with perfect exposure ... but this is great stuff. You''ve created mood by blowing out the whiskers and some of the fur. I really like it alot. I wish I could see a little more of the head, but that''s minor. Excellent Job ... 10</td>', 'I''m going to guess that this shot won''t be in the top 20, but it definately should. At DPC, you''re taking a risk every time you submit a photo shat isn''t tack sharp with perfect exposure ... but this is great stuff. You''ve created mood by blowing out the whiskers and some of the fur. I really like it alot. I wish I could see a little more of the head, but that''s minor. Excellent Job ... 10', '2004-09-14 10:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
