(909478, 103733, 26653, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.<br/>I might have tried draping something over the chair and moving it so that there was a clear wall behind the head of the child - putting all the focus on the the child and the light.  Instead, I''m trying to figure out what''s behind his head.  Another idea would be to have the light on a flat top surrounded by clear surface that would have accentuated the pattern that the light is throwing on the walls.  But I think the back of the chair and the frame on the wall detract from the impact.</td>', 'Cute shot.I might have tried draping something over the chair and moving it so that there was a clear wall behind the head of the child - putting all the focus on the the child and the light.  Instead, I''m trying to figure out what''s behind his head.  Another idea would be to have the light on a flat top surrounded by clear surface that would have accentuated the pattern that the light is throwing on the walls.  But I think the back of the chair and the frame on the wall detract from the impact.', '2004-09-14 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
