(909624, 102611, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I saw this in a portfolio recently?... Anyway I like the use of the light here - very cute and one of my favourites. It''s a shame your DOF wasn''t longer to catch all the dewy droplets and shadow with clarity. Creative approach.</td>', 'I''m sure I saw this in a portfolio recently?... Anyway I like the use of the light here - very cute and one of my favourites. It''s a shame your DOF wasn''t longer to catch all the dewy droplets and shadow with clarity. Creative approach.', '2004-09-14 17:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
