(909631, 102346, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice backlit flower - bordering on being a bit overexposed - but I actually like that effect the way you used it.  The hot spots on the bottom of the step and on the frame at the right bottom are a bit troublesome.</td>', 'A very nice backlit flower - bordering on being a bit overexposed - but I actually like that effect the way you used it.  The hot spots on the bottom of the step and on the frame at the right bottom are a bit troublesome.', '2004-09-14 17:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
