(909637, 103508, 19608, '<td valign="top">A bit centered - would work better if moved left or right a bit.  Excellent use of the sun to backlight the grass - it produced some marvelous colors.  The border is not needed.</td>', 'A bit centered - would work better if moved left or right a bit.  Excellent use of the sun to backlight the grass - it produced some marvelous colors.  The border is not needed.', '2004-09-14 17:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
