(909657, 103914, 19608, '<td valign="top">A subtle image.  Soft colors are excellent.  Compositionally, I''k like to see the main grass top a bit more off center.</td>', 'A subtle image.  Soft colors are excellent.  Compositionally, I''k like to see the main grass top a bit more off center.', '2004-09-14 17:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
