(909662, 102026, 19608, '<td valign="top">You image is about negative sppace more than back lighting.  The small part that is backlit is very busy and cluttered.</td>', 'You image is about negative sppace more than back lighting.  The small part that is backlit is very busy and cluttered.', '2004-09-14 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(909665, 103508, 13276, '<td valign="top">Good shot.</td>', 'Good shot.', '2004-09-14 17:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(909668, 103988, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sexy colours and very good use of technique for a promo image. Like it - although I''m not a fan of stock shots outside of challenges. Crop''s a bit tight near the bottom.</td>', 'Sexy colours and very good use of technique for a promo image. Like it - although I''m not a fan of stock shots outside of challenges. Crop''s a bit tight near the bottom.', '2004-09-14 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(909671, 103826, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely image - probably slammed for no blatant backlight but it''s unusual and you''re almost there!</td>', 'Lovely image - probably slammed for no blatant backlight but it''s unusual and you''re almost there!', '2004-09-14 17:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(909672, 103453, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a great scenic - but unfortunately not a good example of backlighting.  Your subject (title) "Bull" is definitely a silhouette.  Colors are terrific.</td>', 'You have a great scenic - but unfortunately not a good example of backlighting.  Your subject (title) "Bull" is definitely a silhouette.  Colors are terrific.', '2004-09-14 17:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(909674, 103722, 19608, '<td valign="top">NIce colors, nice composition.  The one spot on the bottom-left petal is a bit distracting.  Black background is great. Light ge=reen border is "ok"</td>', 'NIce colors, nice composition.  The one spot on the bottom-left petal is a bit distracting.  Black background is great. Light ge=reen border is "ok"', '2004-09-14 17:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(909675, 103945, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very odd looking shot (positively) strangley austere and ominous. Nice compo and I like the water pick-up.</td>', 'Very odd looking shot (positively) strangley austere and ominous. Nice compo and I like the water pick-up.', '2004-09-14 17:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(909677, 103457, 8860, '<td valign="top">:D</td>', ':D', '2004-09-14 17:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(909681, 103758, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle is perfect for what you''ve done.  White backround is dynamite for the purple and green.  Blue it upper-right corner is odd.  For once a border that does what is suppsed to do.  It holds the image together without drawing attention to itself.</td>', 'Unusual angle is perfect for what you''ve done.  White backround is dynamite for the purple and green.  Blue it upper-right corner is odd.  For once a border that does what is suppsed to do.  It holds the image together without drawing attention to itself.', '2004-09-14 17:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(909686, 103749, 19608, '<td valign="top">Whee - what a fun ride!  Perfect backlight example using a whimsical fruit.  Thanks!</td>', 'Whee - what a fun ride!  Perfect backlight example using a whimsical fruit.  Thanks!', '2004-09-14 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(909687, 103898, 8860, '<td valign="top">Expertly taken shot - great definition throughout. Brochure worthy and probably the work of a pro. Centred comp is strong here and the backlight certainly boosts the appeal of the scene (which is on brief). Deserves a result.</td>', 'Expertly taken shot - great definition throughout. Brochure worthy and probably the work of a pro. Centred comp is strong here and the backlight certainly boosts the appeal of the scene (which is on brief). Deserves a result.', '2004-09-14 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(909688, 103968, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice one.  Not much I would chnage about this - it''s an excellent collection of shapes, sizes, textures and colors.</td>', 'Nice one.  Not much I would chnage about this - it''s an excellent collection of shapes, sizes, textures and colors.', '2004-09-14 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(909691, 102537, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great composition with nice soft backlight.  A winning image.</td>', 'Great composition with nice soft backlight.  A winning image.', '2004-09-14 17:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(909692, 103720, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ideal use of the technique. Nicely shot, if a little lacking in purpose other than the challenge.</td>', 'Ideal use of the technique. Nicely shot, if a little lacking in purpose other than the challenge.', '2004-09-14 17:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(909694, 102174, 19608, '<td valign="top">An excellent scenic.  Althought not a total silhouette - it does come close to losing all detail in many areas.  The rock (?) in the bottom left corner is a bit awkward.</td>', 'An excellent scenic.  Althought not a total silhouette - it does come close to losing all detail in many areas.  The rock (?) in the bottom left corner is a bit awkward.', '2004-09-14 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(909696, 103950, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but I question the need for the second flower center at the bottom right.  White background wworks very niely for you.<br/></td>', 'Nice composition but I question the need for the second flower center at the bottom right.  White background wworks very niely for you.', '2004-09-14 17:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(909697, 103892, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is very neat. She looks like a flower. Very clear detail on the face as well.</td>', 'This is very neat. She looks like a flower. Very clear detail on the face as well.', '2004-09-14 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(909698, 103949, 7751, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this in color. Also the crop seems a little tight to me. Nice picture overall.</td>', 'I would like to see this in color. Also the crop seems a little tight to me. Nice picture overall.', '2004-09-14 17:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(909700, 103979, 7751, '<td valign="top">The dust on the window is a little distracting. The bottle has a very nice shape to it, pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'The dust on the window is a little distracting. The bottle has a very nice shape to it, pleasing to the eye.', '2004-09-14 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(909701, 103759, 7751, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little soft. Makes it almost dreamy. The white glare on the side of the orange is a bit harsh.</td>', 'The focus seems a little soft. Makes it almost dreamy. The white glare on the side of the orange is a bit harsh.', '2004-09-14 17:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(909702, 103613, 21124, '<td valign="top">Could perhaps have been better with some more vivid colors</td>', 'Could perhaps have been better with some more vivid colors', '2004-09-14 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(909703, 103961, 7751, '<td valign="top">The white van really detracts from this photo. Seems a little dark. Very pretty umbrella, I want one.</td>', 'The white van really detracts from this photo. Seems a little dark. Very pretty umbrella, I want one.', '2004-09-14 17:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(909704, 103729, 7751, '<td valign="top">The cat looks great in this photo. Would liked to have seen a little more detail in the models face.</td>', 'The cat looks great in this photo. Would liked to have seen a little more detail in the models face.', '2004-09-14 17:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(909707, 103918, 21124, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered some "younger" pepers</td>', 'I would have prefered some "younger" pepers', '2004-09-14 17:57:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(909710, 103947, 19608, '<td valign="top">Subtle backlighting - for a classic "old Engligh" look.  Black background enhances this.</td>', 'Subtle backlighting - for a classic "old Engligh" look.  Black background enhances this.', '2004-09-14 17:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(909712, 102177, 7751, '<td valign="top">The backlighting is rather soft in this photo, but I think it works wonderfully in this. Her expression makes me wonder, what is she thinking about. It almost makes her look old. Beautiful.</td>', 'The backlighting is rather soft in this photo, but I think it works wonderfully in this. Her expression makes me wonder, what is she thinking about. It almost makes her look old. Beautiful.', '2004-09-14 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(909714, 102023, 20941, '<td valign="top">This is IMHO a Really Really GREAT Shot!!!</td>', 'This is IMHO a Really Really GREAT Shot!!!', '2004-09-14 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(909716, 103919, 7751, '<td valign="top">I looked at this for a while and could not figure it out. Looks maybe like a three wick candle set up behind a glass. There is not enough detail in this.</td>', 'I looked at this for a while and could not figure it out. Looks maybe like a three wick candle set up behind a glass. There is not enough detail in this.', '2004-09-14 18:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(909718, 103430, 14773, '<td valign="top">It gets a low score from me for not being truly back-lit, and I''m a stickler for the challenge.  I start with *1-meets the challenge* and go up from there.</td>', 'It gets a low score from me for not being truly back-lit, and I''m a stickler for the challenge.  I start with *1-meets the challenge* and go up from there.', '2004-09-14 18:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(909719, 103062, 20941, '<td valign="top">bright, love the color...nice job!</td>', 'bright, love the color...nice job!', '2004-09-14 18:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(909721, 103821, 12240, '<td valign="top">Ilove this picture it carries alot of emotions with it</td>', 'Ilove this picture it carries alot of emotions with it', '2004-09-14 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(909722, 103530, 7751, '<td valign="top">This looks too much like a silhouette for me. It''s a very nice shot, but there is no detail on the subject other than the outline of the statue.</td>', 'This looks too much like a silhouette for me. It''s a very nice shot, but there is no detail on the subject other than the outline of the statue.', '2004-09-14 18:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(909723, 103702, 20941, '<td valign="top">great subject, well done...love it</td>', 'great subject, well done...love it', '2004-09-14 18:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(909724, 103724, 14773, '<td valign="top">Sorry -  how is this back lit?  The background appears to be dark and producing no light source.</td>', 'Sorry -  how is this back lit?  The background appears to be dark and producing no light source.', '2004-09-14 18:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(909726, 103729, 14773, '<td valign="top">The cat looks smooth as pudding - not really my style.  If it were just her, no neat image [or whatever] it''d be a great shot.</td>', 'The cat looks smooth as pudding - not really my style.  If it were just her, no neat image [or whatever] it''d be a great shot.', '2004-09-14 18:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(909730, 103725, 14773, '<td valign="top">Love the profile! Sun reflecting in the pupil [however accidental] is nice. 7.</td>', 'Love the profile! Sun reflecting in the pupil [however accidental] is nice. 7.', '2004-09-14 18:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(909731, 103935, 7751, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this. Very creative. Simple idea, very well executed.</td>', 'Wow, I really like this. Very creative. Simple idea, very well executed.', '2004-09-14 18:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(909734, 103884, 7751, '<td valign="top">This one is very nice. Very soft. This must have been taken early in the morning. The rays of light are incredible.</td>', 'This one is very nice. Very soft. This must have been taken early in the morning. The rays of light are incredible.', '2004-09-14 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(909735, 102043, 14773, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE the title and how you came to that conclusion, I think most people would miss it.  However, not entirely thrilled about the shot - sorry it''s a double edged sword. 4.</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE the title and how you came to that conclusion, I think most people would miss it.  However, not entirely thrilled about the shot - sorry it''s a double edged sword. 4.', '2004-09-14 18:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(909738, 102901, 7751, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, I love the brown background in this. It really enhances the fuzzy plant(not sure what it is) Very simple, but very elegant.</td>', 'Ooooh, I love the brown background in this. It really enhances the fuzzy plant(not sure what it is) Very simple, but very elegant.', '2004-09-14 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(909739, 103899, 14773, '<td valign="top">This would be interesting if there were a subject, or if it were just a wee bit more artistic.  Right now it''s just blinds..although at the time you took this it would''ve been PRIME for having a model in.  With the blinds partially closed with so much sun seeping through - it makes light material [like a dress] GLOW..it''s really stunning.</td>', 'This would be interesting if there were a subject, or if it were just a wee bit more artistic.  Right now it''s just blinds..although at the time you took this it would''ve been PRIME for having a model in.  With the blinds partially closed with so much sun seeping through - it makes light material [like a dress] GLOW..it''s really stunning.', '2004-09-14 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(909740, 103964, 7751, '<td valign="top">I wasnt sure about this one at first. It seems very harsh, but the effect is very interesting. You lose some detail on the face. I''m just not sure what to make of this photo.</td>', 'I wasnt sure about this one at first. It seems very harsh, but the effect is very interesting. You lose some detail on the face. I''m just not sure what to make of this photo.', '2004-09-14 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(909741, 102761, 7751, '<td valign="top">I''m interested to know how this was done. Very pretty colors. Nice detail, very sharp on the flower.</td>', 'I''m interested to know how this was done. Very pretty colors. Nice detail, very sharp on the flower.', '2004-09-14 18:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(909743, 103715, 19608, '<td valign="top">Black bacgground enhances your white.  Lighting is great.</td>', 'Black bacgground enhances your white.  Lighting is great.', '2004-09-14 18:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(909744, 102989, 19608, '<td valign="top">Repeating shapes make this work on several levels.  The obvious backlighting is a perfect example.</td>', 'Repeating shapes make this work on several levels.  The obvious backlighting is a perfect example.', '2004-09-14 18:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(909745, 103936, 7751, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better with a non reflective table or surface. Very nice picture. I like the placement.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better with a non reflective table or surface. Very nice picture. I like the placement.', '2004-09-14 18:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(909747, 103538, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your mulberry leaf is excellent  - against a blue that enhances it nicely.  The shapes in the bottom right corner detract from the man subjects.</td>', 'Your mulberry leaf is excellent  - against a blue that enhances it nicely.  The shapes in the bottom right corner detract from the man subjects.', '2004-09-14 18:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(909751, 103575, 7751, '<td valign="top">I think the two people outside are distracting. Overall the picture is very nice. Nice lines through the image.</td>', 'I think the two people outside are distracting. Overall the picture is very nice. Nice lines through the image.', '2004-09-14 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(909757, 103982, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition., lighting and choice of subject.  I really like the soft golden colors.</td>', 'Nice composition., lighting and choice of subject.  I really like the soft golden colors.', '2004-09-14 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(909760, 103750, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject perfectly lit with backlighting (and some fill or bounced light I expect).  Composition is deadly right.</td>', 'Excellent subject perfectly lit with backlighting (and some fill or bounced light I expect).  Composition is deadly right.', '2004-09-14 18:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(909761, 102983, 19608, '<td valign="top">Simple yet very effective.</td>', 'Simple yet very effective.', '2004-09-14 18:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(909762, 103768, 7751, '<td valign="top">Jeez, he is ugly! It almost has an expression on its face. Creepy. Very good photo. Great detail on the bug. I think it would have worked to get the other flower fully in the picture.</td>', 'Jeez, he is ugly! It almost has an expression on its face. Creepy. Very good photo. Great detail on the bug. I think it would have worked to get the other flower fully in the picture.', '2004-09-14 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(909763, 103253, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like th image but don''t see much in the way of backlighting.</td>', 'I like th image but don''t see much in the way of backlighting.', '2004-09-14 18:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(909764, 103049, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusually bright green for a leaft - makes it stand out in the crowd,  The white lining at the edge of the leaf is excellent.</td>', 'Unusually bright green for a leaft - makes it stand out in the crowd,  The white lining at the edge of the leaf is excellent.', '2004-09-14 18:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(909765, 103444, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like the balance of tone from the top and bottom. Great shot!</td>', 'I like the balance of tone from the top and bottom. Great shot!', '2004-09-14 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(909766, 103698, 19608, '<td valign="top">Backligting is nice.  Would have preferred a specimen in better shape.</td>', 'Backligting is nice.  Would have preferred a specimen in better shape.', '2004-09-14 18:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(909770, 102953, 25218, '<td valign="top">Too funny! Nice &amp; clear</td>', 'Too funny! Nice & clear', '2004-09-14 18:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(909771, 103513, 19608, '<td valign="top">The blue cast to the image is interesting.  Not much of a real center of interest or backlighting.</td>', 'The blue cast to the image is interesting.  Not much of a real center of interest or backlighting.', '2004-09-14 18:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(909773, 102327, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see what you are telling me about backlight.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see what you are telling me about backlight.', '2004-09-14 18:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(909774, 103773, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like the way you composed the shot, but I don''t like the orange cast - it makes it look like hell fire or something. I think I would have liked it better in b/w.</td>', 'I like the way you composed the shot, but I don''t like the orange cast - it makes it look like hell fire or something. I think I would have liked it better in b/w.', '2004-09-14 18:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(909775, 102650, 19608, '<td valign="top">An excellent sunrise.  Subtle morning colors are very pleasing.  Everything that is backlit is a silhouette.</td>', 'An excellent sunrise.  Subtle morning colors are very pleasing.  Everything that is backlit is a silhouette.', '2004-09-14 18:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(909777, 103666, 19608, '<td valign="top">NIce backlighting, but unfortunately everything that is backlit is a silhouette.</td>', 'NIce backlighting, but unfortunately everything that is backlit is a silhouette.', '2004-09-14 18:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(909778, 103643, 7751, '<td valign="top">I really like this crop as well as the frame. The focus is a little soft on her eye. Seems the light is coming from the side.</td>', 'I really like this crop as well as the frame. The focus is a little soft on her eye. Seems the light is coming from the side.', '2004-09-14 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(909779, 102682, 25218, '<td valign="top">cool, crisp &amp; clear. I tried to do something similar in my entry, but failed where you succeeded. Great job!</td>', 'cool, crisp & clear. I tried to do something similar in my entry, but failed where you succeeded. Great job!', '2004-09-14 18:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(909781, 103971, 19608, '<td valign="top">It is most likely backlighting, but theres not much in focus.  Too too busy.</td>', 'It is most likely backlighting, but theres not much in focus.  Too too busy.', '2004-09-14 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(909783, 102795, 7751, '<td valign="top">How was this done? I''m very curious.</td>', 'How was this done? I''m very curious.', '2004-09-14 18:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(909784, 104001, 19608, '<td valign="top">Overexposed  and very heavy at the bottom.</td>', 'Overexposed  and very heavy at the bottom.', '2004-09-14 18:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(909787, 102885, 25218, '<td valign="top">It''s a great portrait, and I can tell that it''s backlit, but the lighting doesn''t really enhance the photo.</td>', 'It''s a great portrait, and I can tell that it''s backlit, but the lighting doesn''t really enhance the photo.', '2004-09-14 18:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(909788, 103676, 25218, '<td valign="top">This is great!</td>', 'This is great!', '2004-09-14 18:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(909789, 103935, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea - the backlit water has some interesting sun shapes.</td>', 'Great idea - the backlit water has some interesting sun shapes.', '2004-09-14 18:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(909791, 103537, 19608, '<td valign="top">The hose end is a neat touch - or is that a light bulb base?  Good colors, nice backlighting and rim ligfhting.  Exposure right on.</td>', 'The hose end is a neat touch - or is that a light bulb base?  Good colors, nice backlighting and rim ligfhting.  Exposure right on.', '2004-09-14 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(909792, 103985, 7751, '<td valign="top">Very neat. Simple, but effective.</td>', 'Very neat. Simple, but effective.', '2004-09-14 18:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(909793, 103001, 25218, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the backlight, the lion would really blend in with the background, so it really makes the lion stand out (which was the point of the challenge), so great job!</td>', 'If it weren''t for the backlight, the lion would really blend in with the background, so it really makes the lion stand out (which was the point of the challenge), so great job!', '2004-09-14 18:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(909794, 102686, 25218, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing from the title that you intended to overexpose, but it''s a touch too much, in my opinion - I don''t like how the subject''s face looks like it''s missing.</td>', 'I''m guessing from the title that you intended to overexpose, but it''s a touch too much, in my opinion - I don''t like how the subject''s face looks like it''s missing.', '2004-09-14 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(909801, 103743, 25218, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but the trees are in silhouette, and the challenge said to try to avoid that. Also, it''s a little grainy</td>', 'Nice color, but the trees are in silhouette, and the challenge said to try to avoid that. Also, it''s a little grainy', '2004-09-14 18:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(909806, 102795, 25218, '<td valign="top">Great idea &amp; execution - but the color is off-putting... it looks like someone is serving Windex!</td>', 'Great idea & execution - but the color is off-putting... it looks like someone is serving Windex!', '2004-09-14 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(909807, 103680, 19608, '<td valign="top">Subtle but effective backlight.</td>', 'Subtle but effective backlight.', '2004-09-14 18:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(909809, 102335, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice backlight on the gate.  Your subject (title) plays a very small part of the image.</td>', 'Nice backlight on the gate.  Your subject (title) plays a very small part of the image.', '2004-09-14 18:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(909812, 103773, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting and mysterious.</td>', 'Interesting and mysterious.', '2004-09-14 18:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(909814, 102643, 19608, '<td valign="top">The leaf is nice.  The hotspots on the stem and abouve the leaf are unfortunate.  The border is way too dominent.</td>', 'The leaf is nice.  The hotspots on the stem and abouve the leaf are unfortunate.  The border is way too dominent.', '2004-09-14 18:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(909848, 103206, 26087, '<td valign="top">Good picture.</td>', 'Good picture.', '2004-09-14 19:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(909849, 102276, 26087, '<td valign="top">Good picture.</td>', 'Good picture.', '2004-09-14 19:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(909850, 103695, 26087, '<td valign="top">Good picture.</td>', 'Good picture.', '2004-09-14 19:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(909892, 102398, 25946, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot.', '2004-09-14 20:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(909899, 103552, 25946, '<td valign="top">Cute, cute, cute</td>', 'Cute, cute, cute', '2004-09-14 20:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(909903, 103186, 25946, '<td valign="top">This shot made me laugh. I like it..</td>', 'This shot made me laugh. I like it..', '2004-09-14 20:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
