(910401, 103980, 19952, '<td valign="top">I''m really disappointed that this shot didn''t fare any better in this challenge. The rich color tones are so nice, especially how they change abruptly at the gate line. This is not a typical pretty photo, but it has so many excellent qualities, as I mentioned below, that I hope you''re really happy with it despite its score.</td>', 'I''m really disappointed that this shot didn''t fare any better in this challenge. The rich color tones are so nice, especially how they change abruptly at the gate line. This is not a typical pretty photo, but it has so many excellent qualities, as I mentioned below, that I hope you''re really happy with it despite its score.', '2004-09-15 01:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
