(910492, 102697, 24981, '<td valign="top">Wish it didn''t have the spider web across it''s back. Thought it''d do better than it did.<br/> <br/>I first spotted this little guy about 5 minutes before I got this picture. I was taking out the garbage and saw it out of the corner of my eye as it ran and hid. I told him I wanted to take his picture and ran in to grab the camera. I couldn''t find it when I got back out but a few minutes later I saw it on a different corner of the porch. It stayed and let me take a few pics before it ran off. Haven''t seen it since. The full-size image shows more detail and shows that the whitespot in it''s eye is a reflection of the camera. Guess I should have cropped instead of resize... Oh well, live and learn.<br/> <br/>Thanks for reading and thanks to those who left comments. :)</td>', 'Wish it didn''t have the spider web across it''s back. Thought it''d do better than it did. I first spotted this little guy about 5 minutes before I got this picture. I was taking out the garbage and saw it out of the corner of my eye as it ran and hid. I told him I wanted to take his picture and ran in to grab the camera. I couldn''t find it when I got back out but a few minutes later I saw it on a different corner of the porch. It stayed and let me take a few pics before it ran off. Haven''t seen it since. The full-size image shows more detail and shows that the whitespot in it''s eye is a reflection of the camera. Guess I should have cropped instead of resize... Oh well, live and learn. Thanks for reading and thanks to those who left comments. :)', '2004-09-15 02:04:13.000000', NULL, 0),
