(910930, 102802, 24613, '<td valign="top">Roni, I think this is a really nice shot, although I agree you should have presented it larger.  It seems DPC''ers are not real keen on clouds.  I did a shot of clouds for the framing challenge and got a comment saying he wished there was more to it than clouds.  To me that''s like taking a shot of your dog and saying, "To bad you cat wasn''t in the picture"!  Don''t get me wrong, my shot wasn''t all that good.  But I like clouds and I like this shot.  Hope to see more work from you.</td>', 'Roni, I think this is a really nice shot, although I agree you should have presented it larger.  It seems DPC''ers are not real keen on clouds.  I did a shot of clouds for the framing challenge and got a comment saying he wished there was more to it than clouds.  To me that''s like taking a shot of your dog and saying, "To bad you cat wasn''t in the picture"!  Don''t get me wrong, my shot wasn''t all that good.  But I like clouds and I like this shot.  Hope to see more work from you.', '2004-09-15 07:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
