(911096, 102174, 10634, '<td valign="top">I came back to see how this had done and just had to say something about the "silhouette" comments. On my monitor, it is not a silhouette. I think some people may need to adjust their monitors. If you can''t see the full range on the bar at the bottom of the screen when voting (and a distinct line between each shade) then you need to make some adjustments.</td>', 'I came back to see how this had done and just had to say something about the "silhouette" comments. On my monitor, it is not a silhouette. I think some people may need to adjust their monitors. If you can''t see the full range on the bar at the bottom of the screen when voting (and a distinct line between each shade) then you need to make some adjustments.', '2004-09-15 08:43:32.000000', NULL, 0),
