(911139, 102276, 25623, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by notonline:</b></div><hr/><i> An interesting shot but the flag is backwards or at least appears to be. It gives the impression of anti-patriotism.  &lt;5&gt; </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You don''t think before you speak very often do you?  If you like the picture, great!  If not, leave some constructive criticism.  But watch who you are calling anti-patriotic.  <i><b>ESPECIALLY</b></i>,  when you know nothing about the photographer.  It only makes you look like a prick.</td>', 'Originally posted by notonline: An interesting shot but the flag is backwards or at least appears to be. It gives the impression of anti-patriotism.  <5>  You don''t think before you speak very often do you?  If you like the picture, great!  If not, leave some constructive criticism.  But watch who you are calling anti-patriotic.  ESPECIALLY,  when you know nothing about the photographer.  It only makes you look like a prick.', '2004-09-15 09:09:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(911152, 102901, 6576, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your great comments.  Peggy</td>', 'Thanks for all your great comments.  Peggy', '2004-09-15 09:26:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(911153, 103915, 13547, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this is seen as an image which is too graphic.  It is an excellent composition with great use of focused/unfocused objects.  It is not anywhere near as graphic as hannahfate said:<br/>"It''s like the difference between showing two people looking at each other passionately, and showing them actually having sex. It''s something that is better implied than shown directly."<br/>It has a great impact and tugs at the emotions, and a more subtle photo would have seen voters confused at the point of the picture.  Surely this is real art, that it hits the emotions like it does?</td>', 'I don''t see how this is seen as an image which is too graphic.  It is an excellent composition with great use of focused/unfocused objects.  It is not anywhere near as graphic as hannahfate said:"It''s like the difference between showing two people looking at each other passionately, and showing them actually having sex. It''s something that is better implied than shown directly."It has a great impact and tugs at the emotions, and a more subtle photo would have seen voters confused at the point of the picture.  Surely this is real art, that it hits the emotions like it does?', '2004-09-15 09:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(911156, 102026, 5955, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments</td>', 'Thanks for your comments', '2004-09-15 09:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
