(911389, 102276, 25623, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by notonline:</b></div><hr/><i> Think what you want about me cuz I could care less.  If you actually think about what I said t IS constructive because if you were creful then you should have noticed that the flag IS backwards and DOES (to me at least) look anti-patriotic or at the very least disrespectful.  Had it been facing the other way perhaps could have been an 8. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, until you can tell God which way to make the wind blow, keep the crap that has little to do with photography, and more to do with your own inadequecies off peoples pictures.</td>', 'Originally posted by notonline: Think what you want about me cuz I could care less.  If you actually think about what I said t IS constructive because if you were creful then you should have noticed that the flag IS backwards and DOES (to me at least) look anti-patriotic or at the very least disrespectful.  Had it been facing the other way perhaps could have been an 8.   Well, until you can tell God which way to make the wind blow, keep the crap that has little to do with photography, and more to do with your own inadequecies off peoples pictures.', '2004-09-15 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
