(913391, 102442, 22781, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Philos31:</b></div><hr/><i> Why did you have to submit this Photo.<br/>Sure it meets the challenge and sure it looks nice, but how in the world will I ever win a ribbon when people keep submitting photo''s like this?<br/>I''ts going straight into my favorites. (top pick for this challenge) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hmmm I can''t believe you finished behind me...<br/>Some people vote strange, or is it just me?<br/>Well I still like this one! Had to end much higher!</td>', 'Originally posted by Philos31: Why did you have to submit this Photo.Sure it meets the challenge and sure it looks nice, but how in the world will I ever win a ribbon when people keep submitting photo''s like this?I''ts going straight into my favorites. (top pick for this challenge)   Hmmm I can''t believe you finished behind me...Some people vote strange, or is it just me?Well I still like this one! Had to end much higher!', '2004-09-16 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(913409, 102804, 23561, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say, I gave this a 10 and didn''t comment because I figured you would have gotten pleny and easily finished in the top 10. A sharper focus may have helped but I like the softer focus myself. The picture is very relaxing and I love the glow the light creates under his body. Only thing I may have done differently would have been the crop. I would have tried a portrait crop with the tips of the wings going from edge to edge. But then again, what do I know? This scored higher than my highest entry. Good job, and better luck on your next entry!</td>', 'Just wanted to say, I gave this a 10 and didn''t comment because I figured you would have gotten pleny and easily finished in the top 10. A sharper focus may have helped but I like the softer focus myself. The picture is very relaxing and I love the glow the light creates under his body. Only thing I may have done differently would have been the crop. I would have tried a portrait crop with the tips of the wings going from edge to edge. But then again, what do I know? This scored higher than my highest entry. Good job, and better luck on your next entry!', '2004-09-16 17:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(913439, 102761, 14603, '<td valign="top">You have a very fertile imagination Eric and two ribbons and a near miss in little over a month as a member shows a pretty formidable talent.<br/> <br/>I don`t think that this is the last time that I`ll be congratulating you on a ribbon success.  :)</td>', 'You have a very fertile imagination Eric and two ribbons and a near miss in little over a month as a member shows a pretty formidable talent. I don`t think that this is the last time that I`ll be congratulating you on a ribbon success.  :)', '2004-09-16 18:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(913443, 103915, 10055, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all those did comment and those who found time to think outside of a box for a moment...Your time and generous comments on the picture page and in forums as well PM''s are thanks enough and makes me smile...I know I can''t please or get through every person to be happy with my photo(s)...Not the point...I find happiness to be alive and too not end my life in such way as the photo shows...My camera is just one element that help me to live again after personal interests....there''s more to a photo than one might see.</td>', 'Thank you to all those did comment and those who found time to think outside of a box for a moment...Your time and generous comments on the picture page and in forums as well PM''s are thanks enough and makes me smile...I know I can''t please or get through every person to be happy with my photo(s)...Not the point...I find happiness to be alive and too not end my life in such way as the photo shows...My camera is just one element that help me to live again after personal interests....there''s more to a photo than one might see.', '2004-09-16 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
