(958160, 103966, 22824, '<td valign="top">great colors here.  i know this is an old shot, but you commented on my entry to "communication" and i didn''t see any way to respond in that thread...so i am forced to reply here.<br/> <br/>thank you very much for your compliment on my photo.  this is my first submission and honestly i am a little dissapointed with the current score it holds.  then again, there is a whole week to go, and i love the shot regardless of what random internet people think...<br/> <br/>anyhow, just wanted to say that the photo is of a sign near my flat here in chicago...<br/> <br/>have a great day.</td>', 'great colors here.  i know this is an old shot, but you commented on my entry to "communication" and i didn''t see any way to respond in that thread...so i am forced to reply here. thank you very much for your compliment on my photo.  this is my first submission and honestly i am a little dissapointed with the current score it holds.  then again, there is a whole week to go, and i love the shot regardless of what random internet people think... anyhow, just wanted to say that the photo is of a sign near my flat here in chicago... have a great day.', '2004-10-13 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(961530, 102205, 26246, '<td valign="top">Actually cought in the web is a fragment of a leaf, not a spider.<br/>By the way the web from side to side was less then 3 inches long.<br/>Bye all, thanx 4 commenting.</td>', 'Actually cought in the web is a fragment of a leaf, not a spider.By the way the web from side to side was less then 3 inches long.Bye all, thanx 4 commenting.', '2004-10-16 09:30:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(969583, 103766, 2553, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to vote on this, but would have given it a 7, I think.  I like the color, and the composition, and the abstract aspect of it is interesting.</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to vote on this, but would have given it a 7, I think.  I like the color, and the composition, and the abstract aspect of it is interesting.', '2004-10-22 08:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(969908, 102357, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It must have taken a lot of control on your part to keep from cropping this. It is magical. The balance of curves between the model and table, the sweep of light, the tonality. One of the best pictures I''ve seen on this site. I will keep this as a favorite and add to my wish list.<br/>Sorry. I can''t seem to be able to add it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-22 14:16:42.</i></td>', 'Very nice. It must have taken a lot of control on your part to keep from cropping this. It is magical. The balance of curves between the model and table, the sweep of light, the tonality. One of the best pictures I''ve seen on this site. I will keep this as a favorite and add to my wish list.Sorry. I can''t seem to be able to add it.', '2004-10-22 15:14:29.000000', '2004-10-22 15:16:42.000000', 0),
(972508, 103069, 18722, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  Although it is for the backlight challenge, a bit more light on the center of the flower - just enough to keep it from shifting to black - would have enhanced it.  But, I probably don''t know what I''m talking about -- after all, it did place 12th. :D  Congrats.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'This is a great image.  Although it is for the backlight challenge, a bit more light on the center of the flower - just enough to keep it from shifting to black - would have enhanced it.  But, I probably don''t know what I''m talking about -- after all, it did place 12th. :D  Congrats. David', '2004-10-25 03:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(972605, 103069, 6130, '<td valign="top">Wow, so beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, so beautiful.', '2004-10-25 06:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(973677, 102121, 7560, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the leaves really make this image interesting. The dark line behind the image is distracting. I''d clone out or move the black line. I also personally prefer brighter green in the leaf. But I''m fond of overly colorful images. <br/> <br/>The shot demonstrates the concept of backlighting well, but there''s nothing else to the image. Because of time of day, the shot looks a smidge washed out. The addition of another element (bug on leaf?) would help move this from a solid technical image to something with a bit more umph. <br/> <br/>In voting I''d have done a 4/5 depending on what else I''d seen during voting.</td>', 'The shadow on the leaves really make this image interesting. The dark line behind the image is distracting. I''d clone out or move the black line. I also personally prefer brighter green in the leaf. But I''m fond of overly colorful images.  The shot demonstrates the concept of backlighting well, but there''s nothing else to the image. Because of time of day, the shot looks a smidge washed out. The addition of another element (bug on leaf?) would help move this from a solid technical image to something with a bit more umph.  In voting I''d have done a 4/5 depending on what else I''d seen during voting.', '2004-10-25 21:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(973695, 103943, 18191, '<td valign="top">Hey...<br/>I think that this shot suffered from too little detail due to underexposure in the building. I felt that the building was the focal point of the shot, not the sky. To even out exposure slightly, a graduation ND filter might have been of use. Alternatively, you could use a fill flash through your camera or in PS. The digital camera can only see such a range of light that exposures that are many stops different within a photograph are hard to meter.<br/> <br/>I also feel that the branches are unneeded.<br/> <br/>But...I do think that the sky is beautiful...perhaps a closer crop with a little bit of what i suggested before would help. I hope you dont mind but i did a little bit of editing that might help.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=115496" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/18191/thumb/115496.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/18191/thumb/115496.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/18191/thumb/115496.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Lee</td>', 'Hey...I think that this shot suffered from too little detail due to underexposure in the building. I felt that the building was the focal point of the shot, not the sky. To even out exposure slightly, a graduation ND filter might have been of use. Alternatively, you could use a fill flash through your camera or in PS. The digital camera can only see such a range of light that exposures that are many stops different within a photograph are hard to meter. I also feel that the branches are unneeded. But...I do think that the sky is beautiful...perhaps a closer crop with a little bit of what i suggested before would help. I hope you dont mind but i did a little bit of editing that might help.   Lee', '2004-10-25 22:02:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(981185, 103948, 11800, '<td valign="top">I miss so many good shots because I don''t vote. Wonderful capture. I love how I can feel how hard he is concentrating on being able to get that float to work.</td>', 'I miss so many good shots because I don''t vote. Wonderful capture. I love how I can feel how hard he is concentrating on being able to get that float to work.', '2004-10-31 09:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(986481, 103068, 14603, '<td valign="top">"Just a weed"...how dare you sir, this is a national symbol of my country...we meet at dawn, choose your weapons !!!!<br/> <br/>Before I remove your head with my claymore..I might as well say that you made a very good job of portraying this wonderful plant :)<br/> <br/>Seriously..nice work Tom, thought I had commented on this at the time and was surprised to see I hadn`t.</td>', '"Just a weed"...how dare you sir, this is a national symbol of my country...we meet at dawn, choose your weapons !!!! Before I remove your head with my claymore..I might as well say that you made a very good job of portraying this wonderful plant :) Seriously..nice work Tom, thought I had commented on this at the time and was surprised to see I hadn`t.', '2004-11-02 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 0),
