(1023913, 102896, 21851, '<td valign="top">Very nice Photo, I like the faint colors... very fairytale like.<br/>Heres a couple I took this morning...<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//600rr.org/600rr/Bfly2.jpg'', strrpos(''//600rr.org/600rr/Bfly2.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//600rr.org/600rr/Bfly2.jpg"/> <br/>ExposureTime - 1/1250 seconds<br/>FNumber - 5.60<br/>ISOSpeedRatings - 400<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//600rr.org/600rr/Bfly1.jpg'', strrpos(''//600rr.org/600rr/Bfly1.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//600rr.org/600rr/Bfly1.jpg"/> <br/>ExposureTime - 1/250 seconds<br/>FNumber - 5.60<br/>ISOSpeedRatings - 100<br/></td>', 'Very nice Photo, I like the faint colors... very fairytale like.Heres a couple I took this morning... ExposureTime - 1/1250 secondsFNumber - 5.60ISOSpeedRatings - 400  ExposureTime - 1/250 secondsFNumber - 5.60ISOSpeedRatings - 100', '2004-11-20 09:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
