(1044899, 102726, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning photo. Great concept and dazzling execution. Your comments made me laugh. A sense of humor and amazing talent. Very nice.<br/> <br/>I just read the other comments and I have to add that I really think the amber background is perfect for this shot (forgive the pun). So many alcoholic beverages are in that color range. The richness of the color also adds to the warmth and to me parallels that warm feeling one gets after a drink or two.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-03 15:43:02.</i></td>', 'This is a stunning photo. Great concept and dazzling execution. Your comments made me laugh. A sense of humor and amazing talent. Very nice. I just read the other comments and I have to add that I really think the amber background is perfect for this shot (forgive the pun). So many alcoholic beverages are in that color range. The richness of the color also adds to the warmth and to me parallels that warm feeling one gets after a drink or two.  ', '2004-12-03 15:39:22.000000', '2004-12-03 15:43:02.000000', 0),
