(1107131, 103508, 14986, '<td valign="top">What nice lighting the candle gave you...I would never have guessed it to be a candle!  I don''t always use it, but in this case I think a run through NeatImage or the like would improve the "look" of the shot.  As is, though, it''s really great tones and composition.</td>', 'What nice lighting the candle gave you...I would never have guessed it to be a candle!  I don''t always use it, but in this case I think a run through NeatImage or the like would improve the "look" of the shot.  As is, though, it''s really great tones and composition.', '2005-01-14 06:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
