(1183416, 102357, 33560, '<td valign="top">Shades of Dali.  It''s a stunning photograph.  It''s a shame it went into the Backlighting contest;  while it is a superb and remarkable photo and the lighting is what makes it shine, it doesn''t strike me as being backlit.    The choice to make the subject  such a small part of the photo strikes me as risky, but what a great payoff!</td>', 'Shades of Dali.  It''s a stunning photograph.  It''s a shame it went into the Backlighting contest;  while it is a superb and remarkable photo and the lighting is what makes it shine, it doesn''t strike me as being backlit.    The choice to make the subject  such a small part of the photo strikes me as risky, but what a great payoff!', '2005-02-20 05:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1198380, 103888, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the phallic imagery. The light, the rust, this is a freudian dream.<br/> <br/>Come on- you can''t tell me you didn''t see all this in the photo until now. we take photographs with our conscious minds, we make art with our subconcious.</td>', 'I love the phallic imagery. The light, the rust, this is a freudian dream. Come on- you can''t tell me you didn''t see all this in the photo until now. we take photographs with our conscious minds, we make art with our subconcious.', '2005-02-28 08:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
