(1247500, 103577, 7473, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  The lines in this are great.  I also like the angle pointing straight towards the clouds.  Always looking up!  Adding it to my favorites.</td>', 'Nice image.  The lines in this are great.  I also like the angle pointing straight towards the clouds.  Always looking up!  Adding it to my favorites.', '2005-03-24 08:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
