(1345924, 103420, 35548, '<td valign="top">I think comments like, the image is to small and you should have put a black poster board behind the subject are weak and should be left up to the artist.  Big is not better nor is small...but if the artist chooses to small or big it maybe important to him or her.  I don''t believe in digital photography it is important to stress  every detail that can be destracting in many cases...........If you used the black poster as mentioned you would have not come anywhere the effect you were looking for plus you would have need another light source to light the image in front.....I like the small size because it makes the image more personal as if you had a special love for it going out of your own garden.<br/> <br/>Barry</td>', 'I think comments like, the image is to small and you should have put a black poster board behind the subject are weak and should be left up to the artist.  Big is not better nor is small...but if the artist chooses to small or big it maybe important to him or her.  I don''t believe in digital photography it is important to stress  every detail that can be destracting in many cases...........If you used the black poster as mentioned you would have not come anywhere the effect you were looking for plus you would have need another light source to light the image in front.....I like the small size because it makes the image more personal as if you had a special love for it going out of your own garden. Barry', '2005-04-30 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
