(1734938, 103932, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here - he certainly has the "air" needed for rock stardom!  I think the strongest aspects of this shot are the artist and the backlighting.  I think the weakest aspects of this shot is the overall lighting.  IMHO, you needed some additional frontal/side lighting to provide some depth to the image.  The hair is great - although there are some blown highlights there that I think with additional lighting would be minimized.  I''m certainly no lighting expert (by any means), so would defer to some others on this site for advice on how to fix it, but I do think I can recognize the areas that could use some improvement.  Again, I think this is a great idea and a strong subject; it just needs a little more umph.</td>', 'I really like the idea here - he certainly has the "air" needed for rock stardom!  I think the strongest aspects of this shot are the artist and the backlighting.  I think the weakest aspects of this shot is the overall lighting.  IMHO, you needed some additional frontal/side lighting to provide some depth to the image.  The hair is great - although there are some blown highlights there that I think with additional lighting would be minimized.  I''m certainly no lighting expert (by any means), so would defer to some others on this site for advice on how to fix it, but I do think I can recognize the areas that could use some improvement.  Again, I think this is a great idea and a strong subject; it just needs a little more umph.', '2005-09-24 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1743200, 102398, 41531, '<td valign="top">colours are great and such a creative idea!</td>', 'colours are great and such a creative idea!', '2005-09-27 20:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1814719, 103758, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Good idea and well implemented.  Only thing that stands out to possibly address is the color in the top right corner.</td>', 'I really like this image.  Good idea and well implemented.  Only thing that stands out to possibly address is the color in the top right corner.', '2005-10-26 13:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
